    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Chinese Clothes" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the Chinese character written by Wang Tiande on the silk of a traditional Chinese garment. The artwork features signs such as flowing lines, delicate brushworks, and subtle color variations, all of these are distinctive features of Wang Tiande's style."@en ;
