    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Combinations: Balls of Characters (字球)" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU consists of characters written by Wang Nanming on his Balls of Characters (Ziqiu 字球).\r
The act of rejecting and crumpling the paper distorts and obscures the characters written by the artist, making them illegible. The focus of the artwork  is  on the form, texture, and overall aesthetic created by the crumpled paper rather than the specific characters themselves. """@en ;
