    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Not Too Late (晚/lines)" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU consists of the vectorised calligraphic lines in the video "Not too late "realized by Feng Mengbo in 2009. \r
The artist freely modifies and adapts calligraphy lines,  slowing down the speed of the calligraphic process to one-tenth its original speed, revealing the movement trajectory of strokes on screen. These lines gradually evelve into illegible strokes, characters, and calligraphic gestures, resulting in a three-dimensional, abstract, and dynamic calligraphic video.  Additionally, the character for "late" (晚, wan) appears several times with free arrangements, such as  mirrored and inverted, moving freely to evoke launching missiles."""@en ;
