    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Word Series  - Three one three ten one (三一三十一)" ;
    ns1:description "The text of this CWU written by Qiu Zhenzhong consists of all the polysyllabic words (trisyllabic or quadrisyllabic) derived from the Sanjiao 三角 ('triangle') section of the  'Comprehensive Dictionary of the Chinese Language' (Hanyu Dà Cídiăn 汉语大词典).  Qiu adopts a horizontal and free disposition of Chinese characters, departing from traditional calligraphic norms. " ;
