    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU  Void - Flow (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the lines constructions of wood of the installation \"Void - Flow\" measuring 6×2.5×1.2 meters. The uniqueness of the piece lies in the deflection of its components, which creates a twist between lines and surfaces, setting it apart in both structural principle and visual effect from existing works. It explores spatial continuity and the twisting of lines, offering an innovative experience." ;
