    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Qian (千)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the one thousand characters repeatedly written by Tang Kaizhi in his piece “Thousand.\" The inspiration comes from the \"Thousand Character Classic\" (Qian zi wen 千字文),  a famous text used for learning Chinese characters throughout Chinese history, renowned for its thousand unique characters, each appearing only once. In contrast, Tang Kaizhi's work involves the repetition of the same character (Qian 千) one thousand times, creating a unique and innovative interpretation." ;
