    ns1:description "This exhibition represents the inaugural group showcase of the 'School of Academics,' a movement established by Chen Zhenlian (陈振廉) in 1994. It took place in Korea in 1997, followed by a series of shows in China in 1998, initially in Beijing and subsequently in Hangzhou. Notable members of the 'School of Academics' (学院派, xueyuanpai) include artists Zhang Yuxiang, Chen Guobin, Chen Dazhong, Lü Jinzhuang, Wang Yongjiang, and Cai Mengxia (蔡梦霞), who is also the sole female calligrapher in the group." ;
    ns1:exhibitedArtwork <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1358> .

