    ns1:numberOfCharacters 48 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation "Beginning of Spring, Rain Water, Awakening of Insects, Spring Equinox, Clear and Bright, Grain Rain, Beginning of Summer, Lesser Fullness of Grain, Grain in Ear, Summer Solstice, Lesser Heat, Greater Heat, Beginning of Autumn, End of Heat, White Dew, Autumn Equinox, Cold Dew, Frost Descent, Beginning of Winter, Lesser Snow, Greater Snow, Winter Solstice, Lesser Cold, Greater Cold."@en,
        "‘inizio di primavera’ (lichun立春), ‘acqua piovana’ (yushui 雨水), ‘risveglio degli insetti’ (jingzhe 惊蛰), ‘equinozio di primavera’ (chunfen 春分), ‘limpidezza e luminosità' (qingming 清明), ‘pioggia dei cereali’ (guyu 谷雨), ‘inizio dell’estate’ (lixia 立夏), ‘piccola pienezza’ (xiaoman 小满), ‘grano nella spiga / raccolta’ (mangzhong 芒种), ‘solstizio d’estate’ (xiazhi 夏至), ‘caldo leggero’ (xiaoshu 小暑), ‘calure’ (dashu 大暑), ‘inizio d’autunno’ (liqiu 立秋), ‘fine della calura’ (chushu 处暑), ‘rugiada bianca’ (bailu 白露), ‘equinozio d’autunno’ (qiufen 秋分), ‘rugiada fredda’ (hanlu 寒露), ‘gelate notturne’ (shuangjiang 霜降), ‘inizio dell’inverno’ (lidong 立冬), ‘nevicate leggere’ (xiaoxue 小雪), ‘forti nevicate’ (daxue 大雪), ‘solstizio d’inverno’ (dongzhi 冬至), ‘freddo leggero’ (xiaohan 小寒), ‘grande freddo’ (dahan 大寒)."@it,
        "立春, 雨水, 惊蛰, 春分, 清明, 谷雨, 立夏, 小满, 芒种, 夏至, 小暑, 大暑, 立秋, 处暑, 白露, 秋分, 寒露, 霜降, 立冬, 小雪, 大雪, 冬至, 小寒, 大寒."@zh,
        "Lìchūn, Yǔshuǐ, Jīngzhé, Chūnfēn, Qīngmíng, Gǔyǔ, Lìxià, Xiǎomǎn, Mángzhòng, Xiàzhì, Xiǎoshǔ, Dàshǔ, Lìqiū, Chùshǔ, Báilù, Qiūfēn, Hánlù, Shuāngjiàng, Lìdōng, Xiǎoxuě, Dàxuě, Dōngzhì, Xiǎohán, Dàhán."@zh-Latn .

