    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/1456.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Painful ‘Scriptures’ (针刑、一丈红、木驴...)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance Painful ‘Scriptures’ realized by Wu Xixia at Guizhou in 2024. It consists of the top ten criminal laws used to punish women in ancient China Wu Xixia writes on the red cloth strips, such as: 1) \"zhēn xíng 针刑\" (needle torture), a type of torture involving the use of needles or pins to inflict pain on the victim, especially to penetrate the skin or sensitive areas of the body; 2) \"yī zhàng hóng 一丈红\" (one foot of red), a torture method also known as \"red stick torture\" that was practiced with a stick used to repeatedly hit a person, causing bruises and damage to the skin; 3) \"mù lǘ 木驴\" (wooden donkey), a form of torture involving the victim being forced to sit or lean on a sharp or awkwardly shaped wooden object, causing intense pain; 4) \"yōu bì 幽闭\" (confinement), a torture by solitary confinement, where the victim was locked in a narrow or dark space for a prolonged period, inflicting both physical and psychological suffering; 5) \"luò xíng 烙刑\" (branding), a torture by branding, which involved burning the victim's skin with a hot iron, to brand them with permanent scars or to inflict intense pain; 6) \"pēng zhǔ烹煮\" (boiling), a torture method that involved cooking the victim alive in boiling water or other high-temperature liquids, causing severe burns and suffering; 7) \"kū tī 刳剔\" (beheading), a type of torture in which internal parts of the victim's body, such as organs, were removed or mutilated with the intent of inflicting suffering and slow death; 8) \"jìn zhū lóng 浸猪笼\" (soaking in pig cage), a torture in which the victim was immersed in a narrow cage, often filled with water or other liquids, causing asphyxiation or physical torment; 9) \"hóng xiù xié 红绣鞋\" (red embroidered shoes), a symbolic torture method, where the victim was forced to wear special shoes as a sign of humiliation or social punishment; and 10) \"zǎ xíng 拶刑\" (finger crushing), a type of torture in which the victim's fingers were crushed or injured with torture instruments, causing intense pain and permanent deformities."@en ;
