    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Please Describe Graffiti to a Blind Person (请向盲人描述涂鸦 + tags)" ;
    ns1:description """This Calli-Writing Unit consists of the phrase "Please Describe Graffiti to the Blind 请向盲人描述涂鸦." Using spray paint, Zeit creates a piece with a white outline and a multicolored fill (mainly in pastel shades) in his straight, large charactering. \r
The artwork also includes various tags in white, such as STH, 2G, and FEK (his crews), as well as the name 'Zeit' written in traditional characters '時間.' Additionally, the names Oreone and Leven (two possible crewmates) appear, alongside the same characters from the piece above, also in white."""@en ;
