    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Not Too Late - Orchid Pavilion Preface (《兰亭序》)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of an excerpt  from the central part of the renowned \"Orchid Pavilion Preface\" (Lantingji xu 兰亭集序) by Wang Xizhi 王羲之 (303-361). Feng Mengbo captured computer screenshots from his video artwork \"Not Too Late\" (2010) and applied traditional characters in black ink to inscribe the excerpt directly on the two-dimensional surface, creating a contrast between the dynamic screen-based image and the aesthetics of traditional calligraphy." ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23444>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23445> ;
