    ns1:numberOfCharacters 149 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """People's interactions with each other quickly pass through a lifetime.\r
Some would share their ambitions in a chamber;\r
others may freely indulge in diverse interests and pursuits.\r
The choices are plenty and our temperaments vary.\r
We enjoy the momentary satisfaction of pleasures that regale us,\r
yet we hardly realize how swiftly we age.\r
As desires fade and circumstances change, grief arises.\r
What previously gratified us will soon be a relic,\r
we cannot help but mourn.\r
Whether life is long or short, there is always an end.\r
As the ancients said,\r
"Death and birth are momentous."\r
How agonizing!\r
Reading the past compositions reveals a consistent melancholy from the ancients.\r
One may find themselves lamenting in response to their words, unable to articulate their feelings.\r
It is absurd to equate life with death."""@en,
        """夫人之相与，俯仰一世，\r
或取诸怀抱，晤言一室之内；\r
或因寄所托，放浪形骸之外。\r
虽趣舍万殊，静躁不同；\r
当其欣于所遇，暂得于己，怏然自足，\r
不知老之将至。\r
及其所之既倦，情随事迁，感慨系之矣。\r
向之所欣，俛仰之间，已为陈迹，\r
犹不能不以之兴怀；\r
况修短随化，终期于尽。\r
古人云：\r
「死生亦大矣。」\r
岂不痛哉！\r
每览昔人兴感之由，若合一契；\r
未尝不临文嗟悼，不能喻之于怀。\r
固知一死生为虚诞。"""@zh,
        """夫人之相與，俯仰一世，\r
或取諸懷抱，晤言一室之內；\r
或因寄所託，放浪形骸之外。\r
雖趣舍萬殊，靜躁不同；\r
當其欣於所遇，暫得於己，怏然自足，\r
不知老之將至。\r
及其所之既倦，情隨事遷，感慨係之矣。\r
向之所欣，俛仰之間，已為陳跡，\r
猶不能不以之興懷；\r
況修短隨化，終期於盡。\r
古人云：\r
「死生亦大矣。」\r
豈不痛哉！\r
每覽昔人興感之由，若合一契；\r
未嘗不臨文嗟悼，不能喻之於懷。\r
固知一死生為虛誕。\r
"""@zh,
        "Fūrén zhī xiāng yǔ, fǔyǎng yīshì, huò qǔ zhū huáibào, wù yán yī shì zhī nèi; huò yīn jì suǒ tuō, fànglàngxínghái zhī wài. Suī qù shě wàn shū, jìng zào bùtóng; dāng qí xīn yú suǒ yù, zàn dé yú jǐ, yàng rán zìzú, bùzhī lǎo zhī jiàng zhì. Jí qí suǒ zhī jì juàn, qíng suí shì qiān, gǎnkǎixìzhī yǐ. Xiàng zhī suǒ xīn, fǔ yǎng zhī jiān, yǐ wèi chénjì, yóu bùnéng bù yǐ zhī xìng huái; kuàng xiū duǎn suí huà, zhōngqī yú jìn. Gǔrén yún: `Sǐshēng yì dà yǐ.' Qǐ bù tòng zāi! Měi lǎn xī rén xìng gǎn zhī yóu, ruò hé yī qì; wèicháng bù lín wén jiē dào, bùnéng yù zhī yú huái. Gù zhī yī sǐshēng wèi xū dàn."@zh-Latn .

