    ns1:description """Gao Minglu (born 29 October 1949) is a scholar in Chinese contemporary art. He is the Chair of the Department of Art History, Professor for Distinguished Service, and Chair of Art and is an instructor at the University of Pittsburgh. He is also distinguished professor at Tianjin Academy of Fine Arts.\r
He is the curator of several exhibtion both in China and  outside China. He planned a Chinese avant-garde art exhibition entitled "Inside Out: New Chinese from 1995 to 1998\"""" ;
