    ns1:description "Zhang Zhenzhen is a contemporary composer and pianist. During her earlier music career, she achieved numerous worldwide prizes, including first place in the 8th International Composition Competition in Luxembourg, second Place in 18th International Composition competition “2 Agosto” in Bologna, fourth place in The Molinari Quartet’s 4th International Composition Competition in Montréal and the 4th Palatino International Composition Competition in Beijing. Later, she conducted research on Chinese diaspora composers (i.e., Dun Tan, Chou Wen-Chung, and Xiaoyong Chen). China National Art Fund and SCAA Fund have rewarded her First prizes in outstanding artists 2012 & 2010."@en ;
