    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Tracing the Origin XV_001 (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the lines created by the artist Cui Fei using copper wires and pins in his artwork titled \"Tracing the Origin XV_001\" (2013). Each wire curves and twists in a manner reminiscent of calligraphic strokes, in particular the lines of Chinese cursive script, capturing a sense of fluid movement and organic growth without any linguistic significance." ;
