    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Writing Diary with Water Installation (signs/lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the \"Writing Diary with Water Installation (水写日记)\" realized on view at the Aspinwall House in Kochi (India) as part of the Kochi-Muziris Biennale. It consists of the lines and signs realized with by the public with brushes dipped in water along a translucent wall. Over time, each visitor’s trace gradually fades, until it disappears." ;
