<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1927> a ns3:Q464980 ;
    ns2:P10661 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/526> ;
    ns2:P1476 "Parallel Exhibition of 2023 Chengdu Biennale - Fluidscape (2023 成都双年展平行展 - 流体景观)"@en,
        "2023 成都双年展平行展 - 流体景观"@zh,
        "2023 Chéngdū shuāng nián zhǎn píngxíng zhǎn - Liútǐ jǐngguān"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P276 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q30002> ;
    ns2:P580 "2023-07-15"^^xsd:date ;
    ns2:P582 "2023-09-17"^^xsd:date ;
    ns2:P664 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q109718622> ;
    ns1:description """The "Parallel Exhibition of 2023 Chengdu Biennale - Fluidscape (2023 成都双年展平行展 - 流体景观)" was held from July 15 to September 17, 2023 in Chengdu. It explored the concept of space as a dynamic entity that interacts with human consciousness, a theme drawn from Bachelard's "Poetics of Space". According to Bachelard, space is not just a container for objects but a vital place that we shape, and that, in turn, shapes us. We do not simply occupy space; we create it. The exhibition investigated how we engage with space and context in the contemporary world, focusing on the relationships between individuals, the city, and nature.\r
\r
Through temporary installations, performances, and reinterpretations of urban landscapes, the exhibition emphasized fluidity, transforming space into a continuous exchange of energy between the real and the fictional, memory and the present. This approach invited viewers on a journey that transcends the dimensions of time and space, forging new connections between here and elsewhere, remembering and forgetting.\r
The 12 invited artists presented works in photography, video, and site-specific installations, alongside over 100 photography and video pieces from the Guangdong Museum of Art's collection. As a "satellite" of the Chengdu Biennale, the exhibition connected the local with the global, creating new spaces for collaboration and cultural exchange through a dynamic reading that bridges global and local experiences.""" ;
    ns1:exhibitedArtwork <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1926> .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1932> a ns3:Q464980 ;
