    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Magnified Calligraphy 07909 (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the set of illegible lines of \"Magnified Calligraphy 07909\", in which Zhu Qingsheng selects a character from an ancient calligrapher, cutting away its four sides to isolate and magnify the central part by 100 times.  This work concentrates he key elements of calligraphy—brushwork, construction, and rhythm—into a visual language that invites the viewer to contemplate the nuances of form and movement. The magnification offers an almost microscopic view, transforming familiar brushstrokes into an abstracted, intricate composition." ;
