    ns1:description "The \"Yi Bite: Recent Works by Feng Mengbo\" exhibition was held at Chambers Fine Art in New York from September 16 to November 5, 2010 and marked Feng Mengbo's first first exhibition at Chambers Fine Art New York. In this exhibition, the artist shows his investigation of classical Chinese culture that began with the series of paintings “Wrong Code: Shanshui” (Luan ma: shanshui 乱码·山水) while maintaining his engagement with the digital and cyber world, like in the \"XL\" series." ;
