    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance realized by Wang Dongling the 31st of October, 2011 at the Zhejiang Art Museum of Hangzhou. It consists of some verses from the two poems entitled “Drinking on West Lake First Shine After the Rain” (Yin hu shang chu qing hou yu 饮湖上初晴后雨) by Su Shi 苏轼 (1037-1101, better known as Su Dongpo 苏东坡), an eminent poet of the Song dynasty (960-1279). "@en ;
