<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2036> a ns3:Q7725634 ;
    ns2:P1476 "Recalling the Old Days at Mianchi with Ziyou (和子由渑池怀旧)"@en,
        "和子由渑池怀旧"@zh,
        "Hé Zǐyóu Miǎnchí huáijiù"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P1480 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q5727902> ;
    ns2:P50 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q36020> ;
    ns2:P571 "1075"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns1:description "“Recalling the Old Days at Mianchi with Ziyou” is a well-known poem written by the Song Dynasty poet Su Shi (苏轼; 1037-1101), also known as Su Dongpo (苏东坡). The poem reflects on the past and the feelings of nostalgia associated with the poet's relationship with his brother, Ziyou 子由, and a place called Mianchi 渑池. The poet and his brother had stayed in the temple at Mianchi during a previous journey and written poems on a wall." ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """What do you think is human life like here or there? \r
It seems like a swan's traces on mud or on snow.\r
See the claw and nail prints by chance mud and snow bear.\r
Will the flying swan care what it has left below?\r
The old monk, dead, has left but a dagoba new; \r
The verse we wrote was gone with the wall in decay.\r
What I remember of the journey made with you?\r
The a weary long way and the lame donkey's bray."""@en,
        """人生到处知何似？应似飞鸿踏雪泥。\r
泥上偶然留指爪，鸿飞那复计东西！\r
老僧已死成新塔，坏壁无由见旧题。\r
往日崎岖还记否？路长人困蹇驴嘶。"""@zh,
        """人生到處知何似？應似飛鴻踏雪泥。\r
泥上偶然留指爪，鴻飛那復計東西！\r
老僧已死成新塔，壞壁無由見舊題。\r
往日崎嶇還記否？路長人困蹇驢嘶。"""@zh,
        """Rén shēng dào chù zhī hé shì? yīng shì fēi hóng tà xuě ní.\r
ní shàng ǒu rán liú zhǐ zhǎo, hóng fēi nà fù jì dōng xī!\r
lǎo sēng yǐ sǐ chéng xīn tǎ, huài bì wú yóu jiàn jiù tí.\r
wǎng rì qí qū huán jì fǒu? lù cháng rén kùn jiǎn lǘ sī."""@zh-Latn .

