<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2053> a ns3:Q7725634 ;
    ns2:P1476 "Yuan An stele (袁安碑)"@en,
        "袁安碑"@zh,
        "Yuán Ān Bēi"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P571 "0117"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns1:description "Yuan An stele is a commemorative stele honouring Yuan An, uncovered at Yanshi county, Henan province in 1929. It had been erected around 117 AD and gives important dates in Yuan An's life. Some characters are missing. The stele, 137.5cm tall and 71.5cm wide, is now held at Henan Provincial Museum. It matches a similar stele found in 1923, that of his son Yuan Chang. The two may have originally been erected at the same location." ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation "The lord Minister over the Masses Yuan An Zhaogong (Shaogong) of Nüyang (Ruyang), Ru'nan, inherited learning in the Yi from the Meng clan. On gengwu in the second month of the third year of Yongping (14 April 60), he was made Gentleman of the Palace on the basis of being \"Filially Pious and Incorrupt\". On gengwu in the eleventh month of the fourth year (5 December 61), he was made Master Libationer. In the first month of the fifth year (62), he was transferred to become Chief of Yinping, Donghai. On xinsi in the second month of the tenth year (20 March 67) he was transferred to become Prefect of Dongping. On bingchen in the twelfth month of the thirteenth year (2 February 70) he was appointed Administrator of Chu commandery. On gengshen in the eighth month of the seventeenth year (18 September 74), he was appointed Intendant of Henan. Earlier, on bingshen in the sixth month of the eighth year, (12 August 65), he was appointed Grand Coachman. On bingzi in the fifth month of the third year of Yuanhe (3 June 86) he was appointed Minister of Works. On jimao in the sixth month of the fourth year (31 July 87), he was appointed Minister over the Masses. The Xiaohe Emperor promoted his court dress and summoned him to be an advisor. He passed away on guichou in the fourth year of Yongyuan (9 April 93), and was entombed on gengwu in the intercalary month (26 April)."@en,
        """司徒公汝南女阳袁安召公。授《易》孟氏(学)。\r
永平三年二月庚午以孝廉除郎中。四(年)\r
十一月庚午除给事谒者。五年四月乙(亥)\r
迁东海阴平长。十年二月辛巳迁东平(任)\r
城令。十三年十二月丙辰拜楚郡(太)\r
守。十七年八月庚申徵拜河南尹。(建)\r
初八年六月丙申拜太仆。元和三年五(月)\r
丙子拜司空。四年六月己卯拜司徒。\r
孝和皇帝，加元服，诏公为宾。永元四年(三)\r
月癸丑薨。闰月庚午葬"""@zh,
        """司徒公汝南女陽袁安召公。授《易》孟氏(學)。\r
永平三年二月庚午以孝廉除郎中。四(年)\r
十一月庚午除給事謁者。五年四月乙(亥)\r
遷東海陰平長。十年二月辛巳遷東平(任)\r
城令。十三年十二月丙辰拜楚郡(太)\r
守。十七年八月庚申徵拜河南尹。(建)\r
初八年六月丙申拜太仆。元和三年五(月)\r
丙子拜司空。四年六月己卯拜司徒。\r
孝和皇帝，加元服，詔公為賓。永元四年(三)\r
月癸醜薨。閏月庚午葬"""@zh,
        "Sītú gōng rǔ nán nǚ yáng yuán'ānzhào gōng shòu yì mèng shì yǒng píng sān nián èr yuè gēngwǔ yǐ xiào lián chú lángzhōng sìshíyī yuè gēngwǔ chú gěi shì yè zhě wǔ nián zhēngyuè yǐ qiān dōnghǎi yīnpíng zhǎng shí nián èr yuè xīn sì qiān dōngpíng chéng lìng shísān nián shí'èr yuè bǐng chén bài chǔ jùn shǒu shíqī nián bā yuè gēngshēn zhǐ bài hénán yǐn chū bā nián liù yuè bǐng shēn bài tài pū yuán hé sān nián wǔ bǐng zǐ bài sīkōng sì nián liù yuè jǐ mǎo bài sītú xiàohé huángdì jiā yuán fú zhào gōng wèi bīn yǒng yuán sì nián yue guǐ chǒu rùnyuè gēngwǔ zàng"@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2058> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
