    ns1:attributedTitle """CWU City - Ode to the West Wind (《西风颂》)\r
""" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the Chinese translation of Percy Bysshe Shelley's \"Ode to the West Wind\", written in vertical columns from right to left, using both regular and running styles by Chu Chu in the artwork \"City - Ode to the West Wind\". The artist used black ink and white acrylic, integrating the calligraphy into the shaded areas of the piece." ;
