    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 914 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """I\r
O wild West Wind, thou breath of Autumn's being,\r
Thou, from whose unseen presence the leaves dead\r
Are driven, like ghosts from an enchanter fleeing,\r
\r
Yellow, and black, and pale, and hectic red,\r
Pestilence-stricken multitudes: O thou,\r
Who chariotest to their dark wintry bed\r
\r
The winged seeds, where they lie cold and low,\r
Each like a corpse within its grave, until\r
Thine azure sister of the Spring shall blow\r
\r
Her clarion o'er the dreaming earth, and fill\r
(Driving sweet buds like flocks to feed in air)\r
With living hues and odours plain and hill:\r
\r
Wild Spirit, which art moving everywhere;\r
Destroyer and preserver; hear, oh hear!\r
\r
II\r
Thou on whose stream, mid the steep sky's commotion,\r
Loose clouds like earth's decaying leaves are shed,\r
Shook from the tangled boughs of Heaven and Ocean,\r
\r
Angels of rain and lightning: there are spread\r
On the blue surface of thine aëry surge,\r
Like the bright hair uplifted from the head\r
\r
Of some fierce Maenad, even from the dim verge\r
Of the horizon to the zenith's height,\r
The locks of the approaching storm. Thou dirge\r
\r
Of the dying year, to which this closing night\r
Will be the dome of a vast sepulchre,\r
Vaulted with all thy congregated might\r
\r
Of vapours, from whose solid atmosphere\r
Black rain, and fire, and hail will burst: oh hear!\r
\r
III\r
Thou who didst waken from his summer dreams\r
The blue Mediterranean, where he lay,\r
Lull'd by the coil of his crystalline streams,\r
\r
Beside a pumice isle in Baiae's bay,\r
And saw in sleep old palaces and towers\r
Quivering within the wave's intenser day,\r
\r
All overgrown with azure moss and flowers\r
So sweet, the sense faints picturing them! Thou\r
For whose path the Atlantic's level powers\r
\r
Cleave themselves into chasms, while far below\r
The sea-blooms and the oozy woods which wear\r
The sapless foliage of the ocean, know\r
\r
Thy voice, and suddenly grow gray with fear,\r
And tremble and despoil themselves: oh hear!\r
\r
IV\r
If I were a dead leaf thou mightest bear;\r
If I were a swift cloud to fly with thee;\r
A wave to pant beneath thy power, and share\r
\r
The impulse of thy strength, only less free\r
Than thou, O uncontrollable! If even\r
I were as in my boyhood, and could be\r
\r
The comrade of thy wanderings over Heaven,\r
As then, when to outstrip thy skiey speed\r
Scarce seem'd a vision; I would ne'er have striven\r
\r
As thus with thee in prayer in my sore need.\r
Oh, lift me as a wave, a leaf, a cloud!\r
I fall upon the thorns of life! I bleed!\r
\r
A heavy weight of hours has chain'd and bow'd\r
One too like thee: tameless, and swift, and proud.\r
\r
V\r
Make me thy lyre, even as the forest is:\r
What if my leaves are falling like its own!\r
The tumult of thy mighty harmonies\r
\r
Will take from both a deep, autumnal tone,\r
Sweet though in sadness. Be thou, Spirit fierce,\r
My spirit! Be thou me, impetuous one!\r
\r
Drive my dead thoughts over the universe\r
Like wither'd leaves to quicken a new birth!\r
And, by the incantation of this verse,\r
\r
Scatter, as from an unextinguish'd hearth\r
Ashes and sparks, my words among mankind!\r
Be through my lips to unawaken'd earth\r
\r
The trumpet of a prophecy! O Wind,\r
If Winter comes, can Spring be far behind?"""@en,
        """哦，狂野的西风，秋之生命的气息，\r
你无形，但枯死的落叶被你横扫\r
犹如精魂飞遁远离法师长吟，\r
黄的，黑的，灰的，红得像患肺痨，\r
染上瘟疫的纷纷落叶四散凋零：哦，是你哟，\r
以车驾把有翼的种子催送到\r
黑暗的冬床上，它们就躺在那里，\r
像是墓中的死穴，冰冷，深藏，低贱，\r
直到阳春，你蔚蓝的姐妹向沉睡的大地\r
吹响她嘹亮的号角\r
（如同牧放群羊，驱送香甜的花蕾到空气中觅食就饮）\r
将色和香充满了山峰和平原：\r
狂野的精灵呵，你无处不远行；\r
破坏者兼保护者：听吧，你且聆听！\r
\r
在你的川流之上，长空中巨流滔天，\r
乱云像大地上凋零的树叶，\r
被西风从天和海交错缠结的枝丫上吹落下来，\r
成为雨和电的使者：它们飘落\r
在你缥缈的蔚蓝波涛表面，\r
有如狂女的飘扬的头发在闪烁\r
从天穹的最遥远而模糊的边沿\r
直抵九霄的中天，到处都在摇曳，\r
欲来雷雨的卷发，对濒死的一年\r
你唱出了葬歌，而这密集的黑夜\r
将成为它广大墓陵的一座圆顶，\r
里面正有你的万钧之力的凝结\r
那是你的浑然之气，从它会迸涌\r
黑色的雨、冰雹和火焰：哦，你听！\r
\r
是你，你将蓝色的地中海唤醒\r
而它曾经昏睡了一整个夏天，\r
被澄澈水流的回旋催眠入梦，\r
就在巴亚海湾的一个浮石 岛边，\r
它梦见了古老的宫殿和楼阁\r
在水天辉映的波影里抖颤，\r
而且都生满青苔、开满花朵，\r
那芬芳真迷人欲醉！呵，为了给你\r
让一条路，大西洋的汹涌的浪波\r
把自己向两边劈开，而深在渊底\r
那海洋中的花草和泥污的森林\r
虽然枝叶扶疏，却没有精力\r
听到你的声音，它们已吓得发青，\r
一边颤栗，一边自动萎缩：哦，你听！\r
\r
我若是一片落叶随你飘腾；\r
我若是一朵流云伴你飞行；\r
或是一个浪头在你的威力下翻滚\r
如果我能有你的锐势和冲劲\r
即使比不上你那不羁的奔放\r
我若能像在少年时，凌风而舞\r
便成了你的伴侣，悠游天空\r
（因为呵，那时候，要想追你上云霄，\r
似乎并非梦幻），又何至沦落到这等颓丧\r
祈求你来救我之急。\r
哦，举起我吧，当我是水波、树叶、浮云！\r
我跌在人生的荆棘上，我在流血！\r
这被岁月的重轭所制服的生命\r
原是和你一样：骄傲、轻捷而不驯。\r
\r
把我当作你的竖琴，当作那树丛：\r
尽管我的叶落了，那有什么关系！\r
你那非凡和谐的慷慨激越之情\r
定能从森林和我同奏出深沉的秋韵，\r
甜美而带苍凉。给我你迅猛的劲头，\r
狂暴的精灵！化成我吧，借你的锋芒！\r
请把我尘封的思想散落在宇宙\r
让它像枯叶一样促成新的生命！\r
哦，请听从这一篇符咒似的诗歌，\r
就把我的心声，像是灰烬和火星\r
从还未熄灭的炉火向人间播散！\r
让预言的喇叭通过我的嘴巴\r
把昏睡的大地唤醒吧！哦，西风啊，\r
如果冬天来了，春天还会远吗？"""@zh,
        """ó, kuáng yě de xīfēng, qiūzhī shēngmìng de qìxí, nǐ wúxíng, dàn kūsǐ de luòyè bèi nǐ héngsǎo yóurú jīnghún fēi dùn yuǎnlí fǎshī zhǎng yín, huáng de, hēi de, huī de, hóng dé xiàng huàn fèiláo, rǎn shàng wēnyì de fēnfēn luòyè sìsàn diāolíng: Ó, shì nǐ yō, yǐ chējià bǎ yǒu yì de zhǒngzǐ cuī sòng dào hēi'àn de dōng chuángshàng, tāmen jiù tǎng zài nàlǐ, xiàng shì mù zhōng de sǐ xué, bīnglěng, shēn cáng, dījiàn, zhídào yángchūn, nǐ wèilán de jiěmèi xiàng chénshuì de dàdì chuī xiǎng tā liáoliàng de hàojiǎo (rútóng mùfàng qún yáng, qū sòng xiāngtián de huālěi dào kōngqì zhòng mì shí jiù yǐn) jiāng sè héxiāng chōngmǎnle shānfēng hé píngyuán: Kuáng yě de jīnglíng hē, nǐ wú chù bù yuǎn xíng; pòhuài zhě jiān bǎohù zhě: Tīng ba, nǐ qiě língtīng!\r
\r
zài nǐ de chuān liú zhī shàng, cháng kōngzhōng jùliú tāotiān, luàn yún xiàng dà dìshàng diāolíng de shùyè, bèi xīfēng cóng tiān hé hǎi jiāocuò chán jié de zhīyā shàng chuī luòxià lái, chéngwéi yǔ hé diàn de shǐzhě: Tāmen piāoluò zài nǐ piāomiǎo de wèilán bōtāo biǎomiàn, yǒurú kuángnǚ de piāoyáng de tóufǎ zài shǎnshuò cóng tiānqióng de zuì yáoyuǎn ér móhú de biānyán zhídǐ jiǔxiāo de zhōng tiān, dàochù dōu zài yáoyè, yù lái léiyǔ de juǎnfǎ, duì bīn sǐ de yī nián nǐ chàng chūle zàng gē, ér zhè mìjí de hēiyè jiāng chéngwéi tā guǎngdà mù líng de yīzuò yuán dǐng, lǐmiàn zhèng yǒu nǐ de wàn jūn zhī lì de níngjié nà shì nǐ de húnrán zhī qì, cóng tā huì bèng yǒng hēisè de yǔ, bīngbáo hé huǒyàn: Ó, nǐ tīng!\r
\r
shì nǐ, nǐ jiāng lán sè dì dìzhōnghǎi huànxǐng ér tā céngjīng hūnshuìle yī zhěnggè xiàtiān, bèi chéngchè shuǐliú de huíxuán cuīmián rùmèng, jiù zài bā yà hǎiwān de yīgè fúshí dǎo biān, tā mèng jiànle gǔlǎo de gōngdiàn hé lóugé zài shuǐ tiān huīyìng de bō yǐng lǐ dǒuchàn, érqiě dōu shēng mǎn qīngtái, kāi mǎn huāduǒ, nà fēnfāng zhēn mírén yù zuì! Hē, wèile gěi nǐ ràng yītiáo lù, dàxīyáng de xiōngyǒng de làng bō bǎ zìjǐ xiàng liǎngbiān pī kāi, ér shēn zài yuān dǐ nà hǎiyáng zhōng de huācǎo hé ní wū de sēnlín suīrán zhīyè fúshū, què méiyǒu jīnglì tīng dào nǐ de shēngyīn, tāmen yǐ xià dé fā qīng, yībiān zhànlì, yībiān zìdòng wěisuō: Ó, nǐ tīng!\r
\r
wǒ ruòshì yīpiàn luòyè suí nǐ piāo téng; wǒ ruòshì yī duǒ liú yún bàn nǐ fēixíng; huò shì yīgè làngtou zài nǐ de wēilì xià fāngǔn rúguǒ wǒ néng yǒu nǐ de ruì shì hé chòngjìn jíshǐ bǐ bù shàng nǐ nà bùjī de bēnfàng wǒ ruò néng xiàng zài shàonián shí, líng fēng ér wǔ biàn chéngle nǐ de bànlǚ, yōuyóu tiānkōng (yīnwèi hē, nà shíhòu, yào xiǎng zhuī nǐ shàng yúnxiāo, sìhū bìngfēi mènghuàn), yòu hé zhì lúnluò dào zhè děng tuísàng qíqiú nǐ lái jiù wǒ zhī jí. Ó, jǔ qǐ wǒ ba, dāng wǒ shì shuǐbō, shùyè, fúyún! Wǒ diē zài rénshēng de jīngjí shàng, wǒ zài liúxuè! Zhè bèi suìyuè de zhòng è suǒ zhìfú de shēngmìng yuán shì hé nǐ yīyàng: Jiāo'ào, qīngjié ér bù xùn. \r
\r
bǎ wǒ dàng zuò nǐ de shùqín, dàng zuò nà shùcóng: Jǐnguǎn wǒ de yè luòle, nà yǒu shé me guānxì! Nǐ nà fēifán héxié de kāngkǎi jīyuè zhī qíng dìng néng cóng sēnlín hé wǒ tóng zòu chū shēnchén de qiū yùn, tiánměi ér dài cāngliáng. Gěi wǒ nǐ xùnměng de jìntóu, kuángbào de jīnglíng! Huàchéng wǒ ba, jiè nǐ de fēngmáng! Qǐng bǎ wǒ chénfēng de sīxiǎng sànluò zài yǔzhòu ràng tā xiàng kū yè yīyàng cùchéng xīn de shēngmìng! Ó, qǐng tīngcóng zhè yī piān fúzhòu sì de shīgē, jiù bǎ wǒ de xīnshēng, xiàng shì huījìn hé huǒxīng cóng hái wèi xímiè de lú huǒ xiàng rénjiān bō sàn! Ràng yùyán de lǎbā tōngguò wǒ de zuǐbā bǎ hūnshuì de dàdì huànxǐng ba! Ó, xīfēng a, rúguǒ dōngtiān láile, chūntiān hái huì yuǎn ma?\r
"""@zh-Latn .

