    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU White Orchid: Exotic Goddesses - Wen Tingyun (《菩萨蛮》)" ;
    ns1:description """Chu Chu wrote the poem "Exotic Goddesses" (菩萨蛮) by Wen Tingyun (812-870) from the Tang Dynasty. The characters are written in cursive and regular scripts and arranged vertically on the paper, echoing the image of falling petals. She used soft colors (white, pink, purple) ink to keep the shades of the photos (black and white), so that the characters seem like part of the photo itself. The poem depicts a quiet and intimate moment:  a beautiful woman of the Tang dynasty just waking up and freshening up. It captures her state of mind, suggesting her loneliness. The content of this poems recalls the symbolic significance of the white orchid (purity and delicacy) that is usually attributed to feminine beauty.\r
""" ;
    ns1:directionality "Free",
        "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q42519> ;
    ns1:hasCalligraphicLine true ;
    ns1:hasCharacterForm <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q178528>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q185614> ;
    ns1:hasSignificance "Meaningful writing" ;
    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/2084_HR.jpg> ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2083> ;
    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 150 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """Sleek shades edging spark tones,\r
　　　Milky golden,\r
Smooth hairs falling cream cheeks,\r
　　　Silky holden,\r
I wake up slowly painting brows\r
And fix my makeup while in drowse.\r
Back and forth reflecting beauty,\r
Face to face admiring duty,\r
I wear a figure woven in,\r
With francolins to play within."""@en,
        "The hills overlap with gold, and the sideburns want to be covered with snow. I'm too lazy to get up and draw my eyebrows, and I'm too late to put on my makeup and wash. The flowers are reflected in the mirror in front and behind. I've got a new embroidered jacket and a pair of golden partridges."@en,
        """小山重叠金明灭，鬓云欲度香腮雪。\r
懒起画蛾眉，弄妆梳洗迟。\r
照花前后镜，花面交相映。\r
新帖绣罗襦，双双金鹧鸪。"""@zh,
        """小山重疊金明滅，鬢雲欲度香腮雪。\r
懶起畫蛾眉，弄妝梳洗遲。\r
照花前後鏡，花面對面相映。\r
新帖繡羅襦，雙雙金鷓鴣。"""@zh,
        "Xiǎoshān chóngdié jīn míngmiè, bìn yún yù dù xiāng sāi xuě. Lǎn qǐ huà éméi, nòng zhuāng shūxǐ chí. Zhào huā qiánhòu jìng, huā miàn jiāo xiāngyìng. Xīn tiē xiù luó rú, shuāngshuāng jīn zhè gū."@zh-Latn .

