    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2095.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Brilliant Star - Grain Buds (《她走在美中》/ signs)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the text written by  Chu Chu in the artwork \"Brilliant Star - Grain Buds\". In this piece, the artist multicolored inks to write several layers of vertically arranged Chinese characters. The original photograph, taken by Chu Chu at West Lake in Hangzhou, is partially obscured by multiple layers of calligraphy and painting. Through the use of cerulean and yellow-gold ink, the artist brings a  dynamic explosion of color and energy to the composition. The result is a rich tonal palette, with overlapping layers of varying intensity, combined with a surface as ornate as a brocade of blooming flowers. The calligraphic content is \"She Walks in Beauty\" by the English poet Lord Byron." ;
    ns1:directionality "Free",
        "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q208045>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23444>,
