    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/2095_HR.jpg> ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2094> ;
    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 187 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """SHE WALKS IN BEAUTY\r
\r
I.\r
She walks in beauty, like the night\r
Of cloudless climes and starry skies;\r
And all that's best of dark and bright\r
Meet in her aspect and her eyes:\r
Thus mellow'd to that tender light\r
Which heaven to gaudy day denies.\r
\r
II.\r
One shade the more, one ray the less,\r
Had half impair'd the nameless grace\r
Which waves in every raven tress,\r
Or softly lightens o'er her face;\r
Where thoughts serenely sweet express\r
How pure, how dear their dwelling place.\r
\r
III.\r
And on that cheek, and o'er that brow,\r
So soft, so calm, yet eloquent,\r
The smiles that win, the tints that glow,\r
But tell of days in goodness spent,\r
A mind at peace with all below,\r
A heart whose love is innocent!"""@en,
        """她走在美的光彩中，像夜晚\r
皎洁无云而且繁星漫天；\r
明与暗的最美妙的色泽\r
在她的仪容和秋波里呈现：\r
耀目的白天只嫌光太强，\r
它比那光亮柔和而幽暗。\r
增加或减少一份明与暗\r
就会损害这难言的美。\r
美波动在她乌黑的发上，\r
或者散布淡淡的光辉\r
在那脸庞，恬静的思绪\r
指明它的来处纯洁而珍贵。\r
呵，那额际，那鲜艳的面颊，\r
如此温和，平静，而又脉脉含情，\r
那迷人的微笑，那容颜的光彩，\r
都在说明一个善良的生命：\r
她的头脑安于世间的一切，\r
她的心充溢着真纯的爱情！\r
（《她走在美中》, 拜伦 / translation by Mu Dan 穆旦）"""@zh,
        """Tā zǒu zài měide guāngcǎi zhōng, xiàng yèwǎn\r
jiǎojié wú yún érqiě fánxīng màntiān;\r
míng yǔ àn de zuì měimiào de sèzé\r
zài tā de yíróng hé qiūbō lǐ chéngxiàn:\r
Yào mùdì báitiān zhǐ xián guāngtài qiáng,\r
tā bǐ nà guāngliàng róuhé ér yōu'àn.\r
Zēngjiā huò jiǎnshǎo yī fèn míng yǔ àn\r
jiù huì sǔnhài zhè nán yán dì měi.\r
Měi bōdòng zài tā wūhēi de fǎ shàng,\r
huòzhě sànbù dàndàn de guānghuī\r
zài nà liǎnpáng, tiánjìng de sīxù\r
zhǐmíng tā de lái chù chúnjié ér zhēnguì.\r
Hē, nà é jì, nà xiānyàn de miànjiá,\r
rúcǐ wēnhé, píngjìng, ér yòu mò mò hánqíng,\r
nà mírén de wéixiào, nà róngyán de guāngcǎi,\r
dōu zài shuōmíng yīgè shànliáng de shēngmìng:\r
Tā de tóunǎo ān yú shìjiān de yīqiè,\r
tā de xīn chōngyìzhe zhēn chún de àiqíng!"""@zh-Latn .

