    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Tree Whisper – Tea (《诗经 — 桃夭》)" ;
    ns1:description "Chu Chu executed the characters of the Tao yao poem collected in the Book of Odes. She used cursive style and placed vertically the characters in the shadow of the branches. She respects the vertical line in the execution of the characters, but plays with the spaces, writing the characters closer together, almost overlapping, where the shadow gets darker, and further apart where the shadow fades away. " ;
