    ns1:numberOfCharacters 200 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """The peach tree is young and elegant. \r
Brilliants are its flowers. \r
This young lady is going to her future home, \r
And will order well her chamber and house. \r
The peach tree is young and elegant. \r
Abundant will be its fruits. \r
This young lady is going to her future home, \r
And will order well her house and chamber. \r
The peach tree is young and elegant. \r
Luxuriant are its leaves. \r
This young lady is going to her future home, \r
And will order well her family. """@en,
        """桃之夭夭，灼灼其华。\r
 之子于归，宜其室家。 \r
桃之夭夭，有蕡其实。 \r
之子于归，宜其家室。 \r
桃之夭夭，其叶蓁蓁。\r
 之子于归，宜其家人。"""@zh,
        """Táo zhī yāo yāo, zhuózhuó qí huá. \r
Zhīzǐ yú guī, yí qí shì jiā. \r
Táo zhī yāo yāo, yǒu fén qíshí. \r
Zhīzǐ yú guī, yí qí jiā shì. \r
Táo zhī yāo yāo, qí yè zhēn zhēn. \r
Zhīzǐ yú guī, yí qí jiārén"""@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2107> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q7860> ;
    ns2:P186 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q201851> ;
    ns2:P462 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q47071> ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2107.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Manuscript of Nature VIII_III  (signs)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of thousands of thorns pinned in strict columns. They are assembled in thousands to create serial, character-like units. The resulting panel invites to a reading logic, that according to traditional Chinese calligraphy, is from top-to-bottom, right-to-left, but legibility is systematically denied. Meaning remains only within the material  presence and visual structure. The thorns generate an abstract, tactile surface that feels both fragile and defensive. The echo of conventional calligraphic structure and its \"reading\" directionality are reinforced by white gaps which act as pauses, and a shorter side column which recall colophon-scale addenda in traditional calligraphy." ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23444> ;
    ns1:hasCalligraphicLine false ;
    ns1:hasColophon true ;
    ns1:hasSignificance "Set of signs (illegible)" ;
    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/2107.jpg> ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2106> .

