    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Civilization Landscape (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of a set of abstract lines featured in the artwork Civilization Landscape by Qin Feng, created in 2012. These intertwining lines resemble the flowing strokes of Chinese cursive calligraphy or the elegant curves of Arabic script. As a whole, they evoke the shapes and structures of a cityscape." ;
