    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Wandering Beyond Robe (逍遥游)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU features the illegible text inscribed by Wang Dongling in the creation of the artwork Wandering Beyond Robe (逍遥衫丝质衣袍) in 2017. It consists of the text of \"Wandering Beyond\" (Xiaoyao you 逍遥游), the first of the “inner chapter\" (neipian 内篇) of Zhuangzi 庄子, realized by Wang Dongling with black acrylic ink using the luanshu (chaos script) style. " ;
