<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2180> a ns3:Q7725634 ;
    ns2:P1476 "Daoist Lyrics for Pacing the Void - Poem No. 6 (道士步虚词·其六) "@en,
        "道士步虚词·其六"@zh,
        "Dàoshì bù xūcí·qí liù"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P1480 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q5727902> ;
    ns2:P571 "0550"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns1:description "“Daoist Lyrics for Pacing the Void, Poem No. 6” (Daoshi buxu ci - qi liu 道士步虚词·其六) is a poem by Yu Xin 庾信 (513-581), a renowned poet of the Southern and Northern Dynasties (420-589). The poem covers several Taoist themes, evoking mystical imagery and offering philosophical reflections on nature, immortality, and transcendence." ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """In Eastern Brilliance⁠, a Nine Mushroom Canopy⁠ [carriage];\r
In Northern Illumination, a Five Cloud chariot.\r
Soaring off into Inverted Luminescence;\r
Emerging and disappearing, ascending to the hazy\r
auroras.\r
Spring founts descend Mount Yuliu⁠.\r
Azure birds ascend Mount Jinhua.\r
Han Wudi looked upon peach pits;\r
The Marquis of Qi inquired about jujube blossoms.\r
[The Lady of] Upper Prime ought to have presented wine⁠;\r
And come to Cai Jing’s home.\r
(Translated by Tyler Feezell, 2022)"""@en,
        """东明九芝盖,\r
北烛五云车。\r
飘摇入倒景，\r
出没上烟霞。\r
春泉下玉瀑,\r
青鸟上金华。\r
汉帝看桃核，\r
齐侯问枣花。\r
上元应送酒，\r
来向蔡经家。"""@zh,
        """東明九芝葢,\r
北燭五雲車。\r
飄颻入倒景，\r
出没上烟霞。\r
春泉下玉霤，\r
青鳥上金華。\r
漢帝看桃核，\r
齊侯問棗花。\r
上元應送酒，\r
來向蔡經家。"""@zh,
        """Dōng míng jiǔ zhī gài,\r
Běi zhú wǔ yún chē.\r
Piāo yáo rù dào jǐng,\r
Chū mò shàng yān xiá.\r
Chūn quán xià yù liù,\r
Qīng niǎo shàng jīn huá.\r
Hàn dì kàn táo hé,\r
Qí hóu wèn zǎo huā.\r
Shàng yuán yīng sòng jiǔ,\r
Lái xiàng Cài Jīng jiā."""@zh-Latn .

