        <http://w3id.org/write/thesaurus/ugly_calligraphy> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU I am very sad today (今天很伤心)" ;
    ns1:description "The \"CWU I am very sad today (今天很伤心)\" consists of the phrase \"Jintian hen shangxin 今天很伤心 (I am very sad today),\" rendered in white characters against a deep burgundy-red background, accompanied by the image of a crying face. The visual contrast between the stark white script and the saturated red surface intensifies the emotional tension of the message, transforming a simple declarative sentence into an affective statement that resonates with viewers on an immediate, human level. The inclusion of the crying face reinforces this direct emotional communication, bridging textual and visual expression in a way characteristic of Chinese Emotional Graffiti."@en ;
    ns1:directionality "Modern" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q797446> ;
    ns1:hasBigCharactersCalligraphy false ;
    ns1:hasCharacterForm <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q185614> ;
    ns1:hasColophon false ;
    ns1:hasGraffitiStyle <http://w3id.org/write/thesaurus/anti_style> ;
    ns1:hasSignificance "Meaningful writing" ;
