        <http://w3id.org/write/thesaurus/ugly_calligraphy> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU What is love? (爱是什么?)" ;
    ns1:description "The “CWU What is love? (爱是什么?)” reproduces, using spray paint, the four characters in vivid orange on the gray metal of an Italian train carriage. The choice of orange appears deliberate: it echoes the train’s lower stripe while allowing the message to stand out sharply against the silver background. The writing is executed in a simple, angular style typical of Chinese Emotional Graffiti, where clarity of message takes precedence over aesthetic flourish."@en ;
