    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2519.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 'Heart to Heart' - Label for the  Château Mouton Rothschild 1996 (心)" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU is part of the  label for the  Château Mouton Rothschild 1996. It features five ideograms of the character xin 心 (heart), each rendered with subtle variations in stroke, pressure, and color intensity. The artist intermingled five different forms of the character to symbolize the links between mankind across the five continents.  The work also includes a colophon in which the artist’s name appears in archaic characters (古干), preceded by the characters “Zhongguo 中国" (China) and followed by the title of the work (心), likewise rendered in the same archaic form. The original artwork made in Chinese ink on paper is then reproduced in high-quality techniques, in particular lithography for special prints, while the bottle labels themselves are printed.\r
Gu Gan's work represents the upper part of the label. Immediately below is the wording ‘Encre de Chine par Gu Gan’ (Chinese ink by Gu Gan - on the left) and ‘Coer à Coeur’ (Heart to Heart - on the right), and further below is the rest of the standard wine label with the coat of arms, the vintage and the name of the wine and the winery in classical serif typeface. The interplay of flowing, expressive brushwork with precise printed typography creates a subtle tension between spontaneity and formality, reflecting the dialogue between Eastern calligraphy and Western writing tradition.""" ;
