    ns1:numberOfCharacters 48 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """The murmuring spring threading a melodic rhythm \r
 drawing a long stream through the pines\r
the poignant beauty born of sorrow\r
a thousand paper cranes soaring into the distance\r
endless drifting threads\r
floating into the cosmos\r
the heartbreaking emotion of torn silk\r
lost in the dream of green trees"""@en,
        """泉鳴起韻\r
向松間拉出悠長的溪流\r
悲傷釀出的淒美\r
隨千紙鶴飛向遠方\r
永無止境的遊絲\r
飄向太空\r
裂帛之情\r
醉了綠樹之夢。"""@zh,
        """泉鸣起韵\r
向松间拉出悠长的溪流\r
悲伤酿出的凄美\r
随千纸鹤飞向远方\r
永无止境的游丝\r
飘向太空\r
裂帛之情\r
醉了绿树之梦。"""@zh,
        """Quán míng qǐ yùn\r
xiàng sōng jiān lā chū yōucháng de xīliú\r
bēishāng niàng chū de qīměi\r
suí qiān zhǐhè fēi xiàng yuǎnfāng\r
yǒng wú zhǐjìng de yóusī\r
piāo xiàng tàikōng\r
liè bó zhī qíng\r
zuì le lǜshù zhī mèng."""@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2580> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
