    ns2:P973 <https://www.chateau-mouton-rothschild.com/xu-bing-illustrates-the-label-of-chateau-mouton-rothschild-2018> ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2607.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Label for the Château Mouton Rothschild 2018" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the 2018 vintage Château Mouton Rothschild Label realized by Xu Bing.  It consists of the brand name “Mouton Rothschild”, whose English letters are transformed into visual signs that mimic the structure of Chinese characters. Each letter, through the \"Square Word Calligraphy\" system, is reorganized and adapted within a compact square formation, creating a composition that conveys rhythm, balance, and a poetic sense of harmony. Through this transformation, the text becomes more than writing: it is a meditative, sculptural form, where language is experienced as visual art. The colophon, also rendered in Xu Bing’s \"Square Word Calligraphy\", presents the artist’s name in the same style, reinforcing the unity between visual form and conceptual invention."@en ;
