    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation "Sea"@en,
        "海"@zh,
        "Hǎi"@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/293> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q17781833>,
