    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Celestial Body/Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/B 55 (Li Ensu) Model: One Beach Sensation (lines)" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU is part of the performance "Celestial Body/Zhang Qiang Traceology Report A/B 55 (Li Ensu) Model: One Beach Sensation" [天体／张强踪迹学报告 A/B 55 (李恩素) 模型：海滩感觉之一]. \r
This is the first time Zhang Qiang experiences writing on human body. The woman Li Ensu is wearing only a swimsuit and Zhang Qiang covers her swimsuit and body with black ink traces, turning his back to the subject. Although the artist's intent is writing recognizable Chinese characters and sentences, the three-dimensional bumps and movements of the female counterpart transform writing into simple ink traces."""@en ;
