    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Dezio (度西奥)" ;
    ns1:description """This Calli-Writing Unit consists of three Chinese characters "Duxiao 度西奥" (Dezio's Chinese name tag). Dezio used for the charactering a bubble style with 3D effects, embellished with two lightning bolts and a puppet on a blue background.\r
The character xi 西 (West, Western) in the center of the piece is shaped like a yellow sullen face. It is interesting to note how the puppet xi 西 is interlocked between two red colored Chinese characters that are not puppets."""@en ;
