    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Best Wishes (如意)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the artwork \"Best Wishes (Ru yi 如意)\" executed in September 2022 by Shao Yan. Inspired by Ming “blue and white porcelain” (Qinghuaci青花瓷), the artist writes the two characters ruyi 如意 on a Chinese porcelain bottle vase (composed of a globular body and a long thin neck), employing a brush and blue ink. The character \"ru\" 如 is written in running script (行书) and also the character \"yi\" 意 is written in running script, but its component parts \"li\" 立 and \"ri\" 日 are written using the seal script form (zhuanshu 篆书). Shao Yan combines the structure of the characters and the shape of the bottle mouth vessel creating a work of unique elegance and beauty."@en ;
