    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Shao Yan Ceramic Ink Shooting (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the artwork \"Shao Yan Ceramic Ink Shooting (邵岩射墨的瓷瓶)\" executed in August 2022 by Shao Yan. Shao Yan uses a syringe to inject black ink on the Chinese white bottle vase (composed of a elongated oval body and a double concave thin neck) which is located on a rotating base. Shao Yan’s aim is to adapt the lines and marks created by the ink jet with the oval body and the concave thin neck of the vessel."@en ;
