    ns1:description "Ma Yuanyuan is originally from Gansu Province. She graduated from the Chinese Painting Department of the Sichuan Academy of Fine Arts in 2006. She is currently a professor of the Chinese Painting Department of the Sichuan Academy of Fine Arts, as well as a colleague of the artist Zhang Qiang. She is passionate about \"sword dance\", which she practices at an amateur level."@en ;
