    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Daoist Talisman (道符)" ;
    ns1:description "The CWU is part of the artwork \"Daoist Talisman (道符)\". Qiu Zhijie reproduces four characters representing a Daoist talisman, carving on a layer of concrete. After the plate is dry, the inscription was printed on paper by rubbing with ink, and a new layer of concrete was poured, upon which a new set of characters was then inscribed. The style of the characters is formal, recalling the seal style and a type of decorative style also present in ancient utensils. It could also represent a real seal."@en ;
