    ns1:description "This CWU is part of Wei Ligang's work \"Shadow of a Qingdao Pine Tree (Qingdao de songying 青岛的松影)\" executed in 2010. The two characters  songying 松影 (pine tree) are made with large black ink brushstrokes, exemplifying an attitude detached from a strict technical execution and rather developing in a more loose, natural and expressionist way."@en ;
