    ns1:hasSignificance "Meaningful writing" ;
    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/567.jpg> ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/565> ;
    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 103 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation "An emerald bird wavers on a wintry tree. A thousand peaks are lit by the setting sun. On the moss-strewn platform there are no flowers. The fragrance of warmed wine waft through a garden with pure apricot blossoms. The agarwood and musk having stopped burning, the duck-shaped brazier is cold. Moonlight envelops the pear flowers. Beyond the threshold are screens red and ravishing. The sparse forest gently sways. Where do I draw water from the golden well? Behind jade-like autumnal shadows I glance at the phoenix mirror. The muddled colors of agate swirl like mist. Butterflies tumble across dewy grass. The jade vase is clear like ice as ashes flutter from the animal-shaped brazier."@en,
        "一鳥隨寒翠 千峰明夕陽 苔榭無花 清杏園林煮酒香 沉麝不燒金鴨冷 籠月照梨花 檻外簾幛紅艷幾林輕裊 何處轆轤金井 玉秋影窺鷥鑑 煙瑙撩霧 蝶翻露草 玉壺冰瑩獸爐飛《歐陽修全集》摘辭亂草於京都宋莊 魏館秋窗 傅蝦麓並署翰 剛記。"@zh,
        "一鸟随寒翠 千峰明夕阳 苔榭无花 清杏园林煮酒香 沉麝不烧金鸭冷 笼月照梨花 槛外帘幛红艳几林轻袅 何处辘轳金井 玉秋影窥鸶鉴 烟瑙撩雾 蝶翻露草 玉壶冰莹兽炉飞《欧阳修全集》摘辞乱草于京都宋庄 魏馆秋窗 傅虾麓并署翰 刚记。"@zh,
        "Yī niǎo suí hán cuì qiān fēng míng xīyáng tái xiè wú huā qīng xìng yuánlín zhǔ jiǔ xiāng chén shè bù shāo jīn yā lěng lóng yuè zhào líhuā kǎn wài lián zhàng hóng yàn jǐ lín qīng niǎo hé chù lùlú jīnjǐng yù qiū yǐng kuī sī jiàn yān nǎo liāo wù dié fān lùcǎo yù hú bīng yíng shòu lú fēi “ōuyángxiū quánjí” zhāi cí luàn cǎo yú jīngdū sòng zhuāng wèi guǎn qiū chuāng fù xiā lù bìng shǔ hàn gāng jì."@zh-Latn .

