    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Scattered Needle Script, Looking through the Window (偶然的呼喊...)" ;
    ns1:description "In this Calli-Writing Unit, Fung Ming Chip didn’t write the entire characters of the poem “Looking through the Window” (Chuang wai wang 窗外望) but only some strokes/lines of the characters, so that the characters are no longer recognizable and the text is unreadable. He wrote these strokes in columns from right to left as in traditional calligraphy. He called this type of script \"scattered needle script\" (ou ran zhen 偶然针)."@en ;
