    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 权 - Power, Rights and Authority ( 人权、权、女权、真相...)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"权 - Power, Rights and Authority\" which took place during the \"Festival Perform\" of Vertheuil-en-Médoc (France) in August 19, 2022. Face and body of the artist Echo Morgan and her children are written with fluorescent paint protest words in French and Chinese, such as: \"droit des femmes\"; \"pouvoir\"; \"égalité\"; \"droits des humains\"; \"droit queer\"; \"liberté\"; \"ren quan 人权\" (human rights); \"nü quan 女权\" (women rights); \"dongwu quan 动物权\" (animal rights); \"zhenxiang 真相\" (real situation), etc. "@en ;
