    ns1:hasCalligraphicLine true ;
    ns1:hasCharacterForm <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q178528> ;
    ns1:hasColophon false ;
    ns1:hasSignificance "Meaningful writing",
        "Set of signs (illegible)" ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/700> ;
    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 136 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """I met you in the water\r
And wrote love in water.\r
 \r
I have written your name in sea water.\r
On my hand.\r
Now it only tastes salty\r
Blown away by the sea breeze.\r
 \r
The rose rises in the water\r
And wither in the water\r
But the thorns do not wither\r
They grow in rows inside me\r
 \r
I know your gaze is the abyss\r
If I leap\r
Into the infinite darkness of the night\r
 \r
Now I am in the darkness\r
I pick up again the rose in the water\r
And some faint writing\r
  \r
I stand with the thorns\r
"""@en,
        """我在水中遇見你\r
並把愛情寫在水中。\r
我曾用海水寫你的名字，\r
在我的手上。\r
現在它只剩下鹹味\r
被海風帶走。"""@zh,
        """我在水中遇见你\r
并把爱情写在水中。\r
我曾用海水写你的名字，\r
在我的手上。\r
现在它只剩下咸味\r
被海风带走。\r
 \r
玫瑰在水中升起\r
也在水中凋零\r
而棘刺却不会枯萎\r
它们一排排在我的内部生长\r
 \r
我知道你的凝视就是深渊\r
只要我纵身一跃\r
便会跳入无边的暗夜\r
 \r
此时，我置身黑暗中\r
再次掬起水中的玫瑰\r
和一些模糊的字迹\r
 \r
我和荆棘站在一起"""@zh,
        """Wǒ zài shuǐzhōng yùjiàn nǐ \r
bìng bǎ àiqíng xiě zài shuǐzhōng. \r
Wǒ céng yòng hǎishuǐ xiě nǐ de míngzì, \r
zài wǒ de shǒu shàng. \r
Xiànzài tā zhǐ shèng xià xián wèi \r
bèi hǎifēng dài zǒu. \r
\r
Méiguī zài shuǐzhōng shēng qǐ \r
yě zài shuǐzhōng diāolíng \r
ér jícì què bù huì kūwěi \r
tāmen yī pái pái zài wǒ de nèibù shēngzhǎng \r
\r
wǒ zhīdào nǐ de níngshì jiùshì shēnyuān \r
zhǐyào wǒ zòngshēn yī yuè\r
biàn huì tiào rù wúbiān de ànyè \r
\r
cǐ shí, wǒ zhìshēn hēi'àn zhōng \r
zàicì jū qǐ shuǐzhōng de méiguī \r
hé yīxiē móhú de zìjì \r
\r
wǒ hé jīngjí zhàn zài yīqǐ\r
"""@zh-Latn ;
    ns1:vectorisedOrDigitised false .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/706> a ns3:Q7725634 ;
    ns2:P1476 "Lotus Sutra (法华经)"@en,
        "法华经"@zh,
        "Fǎhuá jīng"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P1480 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q5727902> ;
    ns2:P50 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q335293> ;
    ns2:P571 "0263"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns1:description "The “Lotus Sūtra” (Miaofa lianhua jing 妙法莲华经) is one of the most influential and venerated Buddhist Mahāyāna sūtras.  It was composed by Kumarajiva (344 or 350 – 413), a Buddhist monk, scholar, missionary and translator from the Kingdom of Kucha (present-day Aksu Prefecture, Xinjiang, China) between 263–62. The shortened Chinese title given by the monk is \"Fahua jing 法华经\" (Dharma Exalted Sutra). Two central teachings of the Lotus Sūtra have been very influential for Mahāyāna Buddhism. The first is the doctrine of the “One Vehicle”, which says that all Buddhist paths and practices lead to Buddhahood and so they are all merely \"skillful means\" of reaching Buddhahood. The second is the idea that the lifespan of the Buddha is immeasurable and that therefore, he did not really pass on into final Nirvana (he only appeared to do so as upāya) but is still active teaching the Dharma. Another important teaching of the “Lotus Sūtra” is that all beings can become Buddhas."@en ;
    ns1:hasWikidataResource <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q111141400> .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/716> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q107425>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q283>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q2855609>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q47001369>,
