    ns1:description "Wu Hung is Director of the Center for the Art of East Asia, and Consulting Curator of the Smart Museum of Art at the University of Chicago. He is an elected member of the American Academy of Arts and Sciences and the American Philosophical Society, and sits on the boards and advisory committees of many research institutes and museums in the United States and China. Wu Hung is the principal curator of the art exhibition \"Wang Dongling: The Bamboo Path“ (王冬龄：竹径)"@en ;
