    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 10 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """Mount Tai became as small as a millstone, the Yellow River became as thin as a sash.\r
"""@en,
        "The towering Mount Tai looks as small as a grindstone."@en,
        "泰山成砥砺,，黄河为裳带。"@zh,
        "泰山成砥礪，黃河為裳帶。"@zh,
        "Tàishān chéng dǐlì, Huánghé wéi cháng dài."@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/777> a ns3:Q7725634 ;
    ns2:P1476 "Singing My Cares (咏怀)"@en,
        "咏怀"@zh,
        "Yǒnghuái"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P1480 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q5727902> ;
    ns2:P50 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q142683> ;
    ns2:P571 "0250"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns1:description """This collection of poems  was written by Ruan Ji 阮籍 (210–263), a Chinese musician and poet who lived between the late Eastern Han dynasty (25-220 CE) and the Three Kingdoms period (220 to 280 CE) of Chinese history. He was one of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove.\r
The reference of this collection is the Fan Qin/Chen Dewen edition.\r
"""@en ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """The blazing light extends over thousands of leagues,\r
the mighty river sweeps through swirls and rapids.\r
My bent bow is hung from the Fusang Tree (where the sun rises),\r
my long sword rests beyond the horizon.\r
Mount Tai is my whetstone,\r
the Yellow River is the sash of my gown.\r
I turn to consider Master Zhuang Zhou,\r
neither flourishing nor withering could be trusted.\r
His body perished and was left in the wilds\r
where ravens and kites worked it harm.\r
How can he equal the manly warrior\r
 whose deeds and fame become great thereby?\r
\r
(Translation by Stephen Owen, The Poetry of Ruan Ji and Xi Kang, 2017, p. 89)"""@en,
        """炎光延万里，洪川荡湍濑。\r
弯弓挂扶桑，长剑倚天外。\r
泰山成砥砺，黄河为裳带。\r
视彼庄周子，荣枯何足赖？\r
捐身弃中野，乌鸢作患害。\r
岂若雄杰士，功名从此大！"""@zh,
        """炎光延萬里，洪川蕩湍瀨。\r
彎弓掛扶桑，長劍倚天外。\r
泰山成砥礪，黃河為裳帶。\r
視彼莊周子，榮枯何足賴？\r
捐身棄中野，烏鳶作患害。\r
豈若雄傑士，功名從此大！"""@zh,
        """Yán guāngyán wànlǐ, hóng chuān dàng tuān lài.\r
Wān gōng guà fúsāng, zhǎng jiàn yǐtiān wài.\r
Tàishān chéng dǐlì, huánghé wèi shang dài.\r
Shì bǐ zhuāng zhōuzi, róng kū hé zú lài?\r
Juān shēn qì zhōngyě, wū yuān zuò huàn hài.\r
Qǐ ruò xióngjié shì, gōngmíng cóngcǐ dà!"""@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/78> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q11379>,
