    ns1:description "William Tang Tat-chi is a Hong Kong fashion designer. He studied fashion at London College of Fashion, and established his own brand in 1985. William Tang was one of the first non-mainland designers to show in China in the 1980s and has designed uniforms for airlines including Dragonair."@en ;
