<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/912> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P144 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/918> ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q107425>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q4970>,
