        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q7242> ;
    ns2:P282 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q8201> ;
    ns2:P407 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q7850> ;
    ns2:P462 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23445>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3142> ;
    ns2:P9302 <http://w3id.org/write/thesaurus/cursive_script> ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/912.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Drinking by the Lake: Clear Sky ad First, then Rain (《饮湖上初晴后雨》)" ;
    ns1:description """In the white space around the red iconic Apple logo of Hangzhou West Lake Apple Store, opened in 2015, Wang Dongling wrote the poem "Drinking on West Lake First Shine After the Rain" (Yin hu shang chu qing hou yu 饮湖上初晴后雨) by Su Shi 苏轼 (1037-1101), better known as Su Dongpo 苏东坡, an eminent poet of the Song dynasty (960-1279). The poem is a seven-character quatrain in eight lines. Wang wrote in cursive script (cao shu 草书) the last two lines of the poem, for a total of 28 characters. It praises the beauty of West Lake (Xihu 西湖), one of the most celebrated scenic spots in China. Here, West Lake is compared to Xi Shi 西施, one of the “Four Great Beauties” (Si da meinü 四大美女) of ancient China, women renowned for their legendary beauty. These lines have been widely circulated and are often considered to be an appropriate comment on West Lake. \r
The big calligraphy stretches across a wall measuring 15 m. high x 33 m. wide. The colophon on the left side of the composition indicates the place of realization and records the names of the poet and the artist:  "Poem by Su Dongpo, [written by] Wang Dongling in Hangzhou" (Su Dongpo shi Wang Dongling yu Hangzhou 苏东坡诗王冬龄於杭州). At the end of the colophon, the artist’s seal is applied. The artist's seal includes his surname, name, and the character for 'seal' (Wang Dongling yin 王冬齡印).\r
"""@en ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23444> ;
    ns1:hasBigCharactersCalligraphy true ;
    ns1:hasCalligraphicLine true ;
    ns1:hasCharacterForm <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q178528> ;
    ns1:hasColophon true ;
    ns1:hasSignificance "Meaningful writing" ;
    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/912.jpg>,
        <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/912_HR.jpg> ;
