    ns1:numberOfCharacters 28 ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """Shimmering water on sunny days\r
Blurred mountains through rainy haze\r
West Lake is like the beauty, Xizi\r
With light or heavy makeup, always beautiful.\r
(trans. adapted from the promotional video)"""@en,
        """The brimming waves delight the eyes in sunny days;\r
The dimming hills present rare view in rainy haze.\r
West Lake may be compared to Beauty of the West,\r
Whether she is richly adorned or plainly dressed.\r
(trans. by Xu Yuanchong)"""@en,
        """水光潇滟晴方好，\r
山色空蒙雨亦奇。\r
欲把西湖比西子，\r
淡妆浓抹总相宜。"""@zh,
        """水光瀟灩晴方好，\r
山色空濛雨亦奇。\r
欲把西湖比西子，\r
淡妝濃抹總相宜。"""@zh,
        """Shuǐ guāng liàn yàn qíng fāng hǎo,\r
shān sè kōng méng yǔ yì qí.\r
