    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Brush Array (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is composed of abstract calligraphic lines. The artist uses  several bold brushstrockes spattered with ink dots, leaving little white space is left at the intersections of the lines. The dynamic tension between ink and empty space creates a sense of movement and energy. This interplay evokes the expressive potential of calligraphy beyond recognizable characters, focusing instead on pure gestural expression."@en ;
