    ns1:description "Gao Lu is a lecturer in Film Production at the School of Film and Animation of the China Academy of Art in Hangzhou, where he also serves as head of the XR Lab. His research and teaching focus on the intersection of artificial intelligence, virtual reality, extended reality, and moving image practices. He develops experimental projects that explore how immersive technologies can expand the aesthetic and narrative possibilities of contemporary art."@en ;
