    ns1:description "Yan Shanchun, born in 1957 in Hangzhou, China, graduated from the Zhejiang Academy of Fine Arts (now the China Academy of Art) in 1982, majoring in printmaking. He currently lives and works in Hangzhou. He holds both a Bachelor's and a Ph.D. from the China Academy of Art. Additionally, Yan Shanchun is a senior researcher at the Shenzhen Institute of Art. His published works often explore themes such as Literati and Art."@en ;
