    ns1:description "“Redolent of Incense\" (Xianghuo 香火) is the title of the Solo Exhibtion by Wang Tiande held at Yishu Space (Yishu kongjian 艺术空间) in Vancouver,  2005. The exhibition was hosted and curated by the artist Zheng Shengtian 郑胜天. In this exhibition Wang Tiande wrote charaters on silk clothes using incense in Vancouver, a city where smoking is prohibited in  any fully or substantially enclosed public place or work place. The use of incense gave Wang Tiande's works a sort of spirituality."@en ;
