    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 1 Sans Papier - Song Papier (没有身份)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Sans Papier - Song Papier\" which took place on 30 May 2011 in the Carlo de Carli room of the Milan Bovisa Campus (Polytechnic of Milan) as the inaugural event for the exhibition “Sans papier/son papier ” (held from 27 May to 14 July 2011). It consists of seven Chinese characters written in black ink by Ferragina. The four characters are \"mei you shenfen 没有身份\" (there is no identity) and they are realized in seal style."@en ;
