    ns1:description "The later works of Huang Miaozi, such as \"Dream of flowers, plants, and the three world ages in Suzhoud\", incorporate the style of Zhou Dynasty bronze script, revitalized through the use of bright colors and geometric patterns reminiscent of Australian Aboriginal art, which he had the opportunity to observe during his residency in Australia in 1989, and from 1994 until his death in 2012." ;
