    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/1365.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 Society (0528)" ;
    ns1:description "This Calli-Writing Unit represents Li Qiuqiu's tag \"0528,\" symbolizing his birth date, May 28th. It is positioned between the head of a black man on the right and the two characters of his brand, Shehui 社会 (Society), on the left. This graffiti is executed in a 3D style featuring blue and light blue double depths without any fill-in. The tag is stroked by the large hand of the curly-haired character on the left, creating a sense of continuity between these elements. The coloring and the flowing nature of the writing evoke sea waves, while the drips beneath the number contribute to an aquatic ambiance."@en ;
