    ns2:P571 "2022-02-01"^^xsd:date ;
    ns2:P941 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1478> ;
    ns1:description """"Xu Bing Tianshu" Rocket was launched into space from Jiuquan, Northwest China, on February 1, 2021. This launch was organized by Xu Bing in collaboration with i-Space. The Xu Bing Tianshu Rocket represents a significant milestone in the evolving realm of space art. The "art rocket" serves as both an homage to the achievements of Chinese astronauts and a manifestation of the innovative spirit that characterizes Xu Bing's creative pursuit. Adorned with invented characters derived from his work, A Book from the Sky (1988), the rocket  serves as a medium that explores the arbitrary nature of language and its intrinsic limitations.\r
""" ;
