    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Writing Diary with Water (unknown)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the \"Writing Diary with Water (水写日记)\" perfomance held in 1995 and recorded as a set of four photographs. It consists of characters written by Song Dong on a flat stone with a brush soaked in water. The characters are written in regular script, from right to left and from top to bottom to form columns as in calligraphic tradition. They represents is Song Dong's personal diary but the content is unknown due to the fleeting nature of its water writing. " ;
