    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """The ground collapsed and the mountain crumbled - warrior heroes died, \r
and only then was this road in the sky linked with a plank road. \r
(Translated by Iezzi and Meccarelli)\r
"""@en,
        """Up to the summit of Emei Peak --  \r
Which was broken once by an earthquake and there were brave men lost,  \r
Just finishing the stone rungs of their ladder toward heaven. \r
(Translated by Witter Bynner)"""@en,
        """地崩山摧壮士死 ，\r
然后天梯石栈相钩连 。\r
"""@zh,
