    ns1:attributedTitle """CWU Chinese Calligraphy meets Shamanic Music (色不異空...)\r
"""@en ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the musicalligraphy performance entitled \"Chinese Calligraphy meet Shamanic Music\" realized by Silvio Ferragina and Sainko Namtchylak. It consists on some verses of the “Heart Sutra” with different calligraphic styles: seal script (zhuanshu), cursive script (caoshu) and regular script (kaishu). During the performance, Silvio also uses a particular writing technique in which he employs a dry brush (resembling the feibai) that he then soaks in ink and drip onto the transcribed characters, reminiscent of the dripping technique." ;
