    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 Inky Strings: Old Friends from Mountains and Rivers (multiple languages)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Inky Strings: Old Friends from Mountain and River,\" created by Echo Morgan and Zhang Yaqin, held at the International Museum and Library of Bologna on October 29th, 2023. It consists of words and phrases written in different languages by the public on the artis's body, as well as on the long silk scroll where Echo Morgan walked during the performance. People wrote words, such as: “Speranza” and “Fiore” (“hope” and “flower” in Italian); “paqe” (“peace”, in Albanian); “amour” (“love”, in French), “jia you 加油” (“come on”, in Chinese), \"no more war\" or \"save the world\" (in English)."@en ;
