    ns1:description "MAAP’s 2006 media art festival, \"Out of the Internet\", realized an interconnected and context-articulate exhibition presence of net-based work across a range of locations from elite museums, galleries, library networks and into a cascade of urban spaces with a select group of artists based in Asia and working in or connected through internet art practice. It represents the key exhibition component of the 2006 MAAP festival." ;
