    ns1:description "Feng Mengbo created a series of ink and mixed-media paintings and works on paper, capturing isolated moments from the video piece “Not Too Late\" (2010), and transferring them to canvas and paper. These works were first displayed in the exhibition \"Not Too Late - Recent Works by Feng Mengbo\" held at Chambers Fine Art Gallery in Beijing in 2012, and subsequently in New York in 2013." ;
