    ns1:description "The exhibition \"EAST AND WEST, PAST AND PRESENT: Zhang Aiguo  & Silvio Ferragina – Contemporary Calligraphy Exhibition\", curated by Adriana Iezzi, Professor at the University of Bologna and Principal Investigator of the WRITE Project, was held at Artex – Center for Artistic and Traditional Crafts of Tuscany in Florence from July 2 to 16, 2024. This exhibition of new calligraphic works by contemporary artists Zhang Aiguo and Silvio Ferragina in Florence symbolizes not only an exchange and fusion between Eastern and Western cultures but also offers a three-dimensional exploration of the juxtaposition between ancient and modern times, as reflected in the exhibition's title." ;
