    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU2 Living Word (鸟）" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU is the dictionary definition of the word niǎo 鸟 (鳥; bird) transcribed on a platform placed on the ground from which various forms of the character departs into the sky, breaking away from the confines of the literal definition and taking flight through the installation space.  \r
The dictionary entry includes: 1) the pronunciation of the character transcribed with two transliteration systems of Mandarin Chinese, the romanization system called pinyin (拼音), and the Bopomofo, also called Zhuyin Fuhao (注音符号); and 2) the definition of the word "bird".   """ ;
