    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2  Love (CHANGE)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of a dress designed by Vivienne Tam for her Fall-Winter 2013 \"Ready-to-Wear\" collection and presented at New York Fashion Week in 2013. It consists of a vertical sequence of Latin letters in white colors on a red and black background that intersects the dress forming the word \"CHANGE\". These letters are realized under the Chinese character \"ai 爱\" (love), creating a dialogue between Chinese and English languages and Eastern and Western cultures." ;
