    ns1:attributedTitle " CWU 1 I am sick (我有病)" ;
    ns1:description "The \"CWU 1 I am sick (我有病)\" is composed of only three characters, wo you bing (我有病, “I am sick”), repeated some thirty-four times to cover the entire wall. This insistence on repetition seems deliberate, evoking a sense of obsession, torment, and vulnerability, emotions intimately linked with illness. The relentless pattern transforms the simple statement into a visual and psychological echo, amplifying the all-consuming nature of suffering and hinting at struggles that reach far beyond the physical body."@en ;
