    ns1:description """Speechless #1–2 (无言 #1–2), also known as "Soundless Speech 1-2" (Wusheng yanjiang zhi yi, zhi er 无声演讲之壹、之贰), is a performance in which Gu Wenda delivered a lively yet wordless speech in front of monumental, unreadable characters painted by the artist, which served as the backdrop for the performance. The characters are part of the series "Pseudo-Character Series" (Xugou wenzi xilie 虚构文字系列, 1984-1986) .  One of the artworks in front of the artist is "Synthesized  Words" (Chang shen 畅神, 1985). \r
The performance is repeated in 1986 at the Xi'an Artists' Gallery (Speechless #4). \r
"""@en ;
