    ns1:numberOfCharacters 65 ;
    ns1:relatedUnit <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1582> ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """It is the ninth year of Emperor Mu of Jin's Yonghe era\r
The year of the Yin Water Ox,\r
At the beginning of the third lunar month,\r
We are all gathered at the orchid pavilion in Shanyin County, Guiji Commandery,\r
For the Spring Purification Festival.\r
All of the prominent people have arrived,\r
From old to young.\r
This is an area of high mountains and lofty peaks,\r
With an exuberant growth of trees and bamboos,\r
It also has clear rushing water,\r
Reflecting the sunlight as it flows past either side of the pavilion.\r
The guests are seated side by side to play the drinking game where a wine cup is floated down the stream and the first person sitting in front of the cup when it stops must drink."""@en,
        """永和九年,岁在癸丑,\r
暮春之初,\r
会于会稽山阴之兰亭,\r
修禊事也。\r
群贤毕至,\r
少长咸集。\r
此地有崇山峻岭,\r
茂林修竹,\r
又有清流激湍,\r
映带左右。\r
引以为流觞曲水,\r
列坐其次。\r
"""@zh,
        """永和九年，歲在癸丑，\r
暮春之初，\r
會於會稽山陰之蘭亭，\r
修禊事也。\r
群賢畢至，\r
少長咸集。\r
此地有崇山峻嶺，\r
茂林修竹，\r
又有清流激湍，\r
映帶左右。\r
引以為流觴曲水，\r
列坐其次。"""@zh,
        """Yǒnghé jiǔ nián, suì zài guǐchǒu,\r
mù chūn zhī chū,\r
huì yú Kuàijī shān yīn zhī Lán Tíng,\r
xiū xì shì yě.\r
Qún xián bì zhì,\r
shào zhǎng xián jí.\r
Cǐ dì yǒu chóng shān jùn lǐng,\r
mào lín xiū zhú,\r
yòu yǒu qīng liú jī tuān,\r
yìng dài zuǒ yòu.\r
yǐn yǐ wéi liú shāng qū shuǐ,\r
liè zuò qí cì."""@zh-Latn ;
    ns1:vectorisedOrDigitised true .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2386> a ns3:Q17514 ;
    ns2:P1476 "Reality is meant to be escaped (现实就是用来逃避的)"@en,
        "现实就是用来逃避的"@zh,
        "現實就是用來逃避的"@zh,
        "Xiànshí jiù shì yòng lái táobì de"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P179 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2383> ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q50388354> ;
    ns2:P186 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3055935>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q42948> ;
    ns2:P276 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1867> ;
    ns2:P462 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23445> ;
    ns2:P571 "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns2:P6375 "Dajia Riverside Park, Taipei"@en ;
    ns1:description """This graffiti piece, executed in black spray paint on a repainted wall that had been used to cover a previous work (likely a puppet or cartoon-style figure common in graffiti culture) presents a stark textual statement: Xianshi jiushi yonglai taobi de 現實就是用來逃避的 (“Reality is meant to be escaped”).\r
The writer intentionally used traditional Chinese characters, reflecting the linguistic and cultural environment of Taipei. This choice situates the work firmly within its local context while simultaneously engaging in a broader dialogue with Chinese-language graffiti practices across different regions.\r
The act of writing directly over a freshly buffed surface transforms the gesture into both a defiance and a reflection. The faint traces of the earlier graffiti beneath the new layer of paint remain visible, creating a visual and conceptual dialogue between erasure and re-inscription. Through this interplay, the work questions the cyclical nature of visibility and disappearance in public art.\r
The phrase itself functions as an existential commentary on contemporary urban life. Within this context, “reality” becomes a metaphor for systems of control, regulation, or monotony, while the graffiti act embodies a form of temporary liberation. The tension between erasure and expression situates the piece within a discourse of resistance—where the buffed wall, rather than silencing expression, becomes a renewed surface for reflection, irony, and persistence."""@en ;
