    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Synthesized Words (易、 申、示、畅神)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the artwork entitled \"Synthesized Words\" (Chang shen 畅 神). The unit is composed by three cursive-script components (yi 易, shen 申, shi 示 ) which may be interpreted as the character for “unobstructed” (chang 畅 ) and that for “spirit” (shen 神). The characters seem to be suspended over a landscape. Gu Wenda uses this artwork as a backdrop during the performance \"Speechless #1-2\" (Wu yan #1-2 无言 #1-2). "@en ;
