<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2482> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P282 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q41670> ;
    ns2:P407 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1860> ;
    ns2:P462 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23445> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 Shanghai 2010 Expo Logo (Expo Shanghai China)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the logo of the Shanghai 2010 Expo. It consists of the inscription “Expo Shanghai China” rendered in latin letters and in modern sans-serif typeface, visually separated from the main graphic component of the logo. Its primary function is to identify the name and location of the event for an international audience, thereby complementing the overall global communication of the emblem. The use of a clean, contemporary typeface emphasizes clarity and legibility, contrasting with the fluid, calligraphic style of the central character shi 世 and the brush-like numerals, and creating a harmonious balance between traditional Chinese elements and modern typographic conventions. " ;
