<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2517> a ns1:DecorativeAndAppliedArt ;
    ns2:P1476 "Gu Gan for Château Mouton Rothschild - 'Heart to Heart' label for the 1996 Château Mouton Rothschild"@en,
        "Coeur à Coeur"@fr,
        "心连心"@zh,
        "Xīn lián xīn"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1072>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1094542>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q11372281>,
