    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Writing the 'Orchid Pavilion Preface' One Thousand Times (《兰亭序》)" ;
    ns1:description "The poem written by Qiu Zhijie is the \"Orchid Pavilion Preface\" (Lanting Xu 兰亭序)  composed by Wang Xizhi in 353 AD. Qiu Zhijie repeatedly copies the work a thousand times on the same piece of rice papersheet."@en ;
