        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3142>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q943> ;
    ns2:P571 "2018"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns2:P856 <https://www.chateau-mouton-rothschild.com/xu-bing-illustrates-the-label-of-chateau-mouton-rothschild-2018#> ;
    ns2:P88 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1061469> ;
    ns2:P941 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q65047693> ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2605.jpg> ;
    ns1:calligrapher <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1096> ;
    ns1:description """For the label of the 2018 vintage, one of France’s most celebrated and prestigious wineries, Château Mouton Rothschild chose the renowned Chinese artist Xu Bing, master of "Square Word Calligraphy", an innovative calligraphic system in which English words visually take on the appearance of Chinese characters, while remaining readable as Latin letters. Rather than writing the letters in a linear sequence, Xu Bing reorganizes and subtly adapts them within a compact square structure, echoing the uniformity of Chinese characters.\r
The label features the letters composing the brand name “Mouton Rothschild”, aesthetically transformed into calligraphic signs that maintain rhythm, harmony, and poetic legibility. The composition conveys fluidity and movement, turning the writing into a true visual meditation. The colophon on the right-hand side of the label also presents the artist’s name in the style of "Square Word Calligraphy"."""@en ;
