    ns1:description "The CWU of the eight artworks created during the performance \"Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/X7 (Zhang Kaini) [张强踪迹学报告 A/X7 (张凯妮) 模型]\" are the result of the interaction between Zhang Qiang and Zhang Kaini. These CWU are composed of \"abstract\" calligraphic lines and body prints."@en ;
