    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/346.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/B 94 (Cao Rui) Model (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is the result of the \"Zhang Qiang Traceology Report A/B 94 (Cao Rui) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/B 94 (曹蕊) 模型]\". In this performance, Zhang Qiang introduces the new concept of “conceptual clothing” (“观念服装”). For this performance, Zhang Qiang collaborates with Zhao Jingyu 赵泾羽, a Beijing fashion designer specializing in western styles who makes dresses for him out of white calligraphy paper. Her creations are put on by the professional model Cao Rui 曹蕊, who assists Zhang Qiang in his art by allowing him to paint on the paper dresses she is wearing. The result of the performances are only unreadable black ink traces (lines and spots). "@en ;
