    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Ink Shooting (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Ink Shooting\" (射墨) executed by Shao Yan in 2017 at the \"Taishan Large-Scale Painting and Calligraphy Art Expo\" - Shangdong province (泰山大型书画艺术品博览会). The calligraphic lines are made of streams of ink, created using four syringes which squirt ink on a long sheet of paper by means of sudden movements of the artist. "@en ;
