    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Biface Graphy - Ink Action in Venice (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Biface Graphy - Ink Action in Venice (双面书法 - 威尼斯行墨)\". Lines are realized by Zhang Qiang and Lia Wei with calligraphic brushes and ink; they are not readable, but constructed through the interaction of the two brushes writing simultaneously, conscious of each other’s movement."@en ;
