<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/450> a ns3:Q7725310 ;
    ns2:P1071 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q42622> ;
    ns2:P1476 "Shao Yan Blue and White  Porcelain - Bird Seal Script Series (邵岩蓝百瓷器 - 鸟篆系列)"@en,
        "邵岩蓝百瓷器 - 鸟篆系列"@zh,
        "Shào Yán lán bǎi cíqì - Niǎo zhuàn xìliè"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P170 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/277> ;
    ns2:P580 "2015"^^xsd:gYear ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/450.jpg> ;
    ns1:description """This series was executed in 2015 by Shao Yan and was exhibited the same year (May 15 – June 7) at the "Calligraphy and Ceramics Art Exhibition" (Shufa taoci yishu zhan 书法陶瓷艺术展) opened in Suzhou at the Ming Art Museum (Ming meishuguan 明·美术馆). The exhibition, called “Between Squares and Circles” (fangyuan zhejian 方圆之间), featured 60 pieces of calligraphy works carried out by three outstanding young and middle-aged calligraphers in contemporary China: Shao Yan, Li Qiang 李强 and Xu Guixun 徐圭逊. \r
The works present forms and styles similar to circles and squares. Shao Yan engraved characters on the surface of the vessel and then filled in the blue color. The characters recall the "bird seal script" (niao zhuan 鸟篆), a kind of artistic script in common use during the late Warring States period (475-221 BC). This script is characterized by gently and intricated curved lines decorated with bird designs. In these works, Shao Yan re-elaborates this script in a naïf style.\r
In this exhibition, six vases of this series are displayed: three "maotong"(帽筒) vases in ceramics entitled “Spring and Autumn” (春华秋实) and “Good as Water” (Shangshanruoshui 上善若水); two little quivers of arrows called “To do Good without Fame or Fortune” (Qi yinguo bao fang xingshan, bu wei mingli yi dushu 豈因果报方行善，不为名利亦读书); a jade pot spring vase called “Namo Amithaba Buddha” (Namo Emituofo 南无阿弥陀佛) and a water-washed porcelain bowl called “Harmony in the Family” (Jia he wanshi xing 家和万事兴)."""@en ;
    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/450.jpg> ;
    ns1:includesArtwork <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/448> .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/480> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
