    ns1:description "This poem, written by Fung Ming Chip, describes the scenery he sees through his studio window."@en ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """An accidental cry\r
Recall the infinite\r
Green hills and blue waters\r
Mixed in one\r
Silence"""@en,
        """偶然的呼喊\r
勾起無限\r
青山綠水\r
混成一片的\r
靜默"""@zh,
