    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Anatomy of Posidonia (lines)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Anatomy of Posidonia\" realized by Echo Morgan in occasion of the 3rd Edition of the \"Territori - Ibiza Performance Art Festival\" (17-25 September, 2022) which takes place in Ibiza, Spain. The CWU consists of traces and marks leaved by the artist's hair which are dipped in a compound made of chlorophyll powder mixed with seawater. With various body movements, accompanied by some verses and vocal sounds, the artist becomes a brush and leaves \"imprints\" and marks of her body's passage on the sheet."@en ;
