    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Woman 女+ Horse 马 = Mother 妈  (自由、海、好、婆婆...)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Woman 女+ Horse 马 = Mother 妈\" realized by Echo Morgan, which took place in 2022 at the TJ Boulting of London during \"Love, Celebration and the Road Ahead\", a three-day festival (September, 29 - October, 1st ) to mark the launch of Hettie Judah's book entitled \"How Not To Exclude Artist Mothers (and other parents)\". The character \"ma 妈\" is written in blue/green ink, as well as her clothes are drenched in the same ink. The artist then wraps white lanterns with various writings around her body, combining Chinese characters with the English language, such as: \"ziyou 自由\" (freedom); \"hai 海\" (sea); \"hao 好\" (good); \"popo 婆婆\" (grandmother); \"shengming 生命\" (life); \"tudi 土地\" (soil); \"tielian 铁链\" (iron chain); \"Can be a good mum and a good artist?\"; \"The Chinese word mum is combined woman 女 + horse 马\"; \"Flying dress\"; \"Mothers are the best in the world if you have one you are precious\"; \"Yellow face wife\", \"Sea Big Ocean like Mother Care\", \"Don’t get greedy. Only harvest for as long as you can hold your breath\", etc."@en ;
