    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Darling (救救我 、求求你、别杀我... )" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the artwork genarated during the performance \"Darling\", that was held in Macau in 2021. It consists of the characters written by Wu Xixia inside an inflatable hermetic sphere in front of a building called \"Darling\". The building was covered with red ribbons, which spread all the way to the inflatable ball. Inside the hermetic sphere, Wu Xixia using brush and red acrylic paint wrote sentences like: \"jiu jiu wo 救救我\" (help me); \"qiuqiu ni 求求你\" (I beg you), \"bie sha wo 别杀我\" (don't kill me); \"bie S wo  别S我\" (don't fuck me), etc."@en ;
