    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU “Sexual” Calligraphy (《兰亭序》)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Sexual\" Calligrpahy (“性” 书法). It consists of the characters realized by Luo Shan. The artist, using a copybook, rewrites the characters of the \"Orchid Pavilion Preface\" composed by Wang Xizhi 王羲之 (303–361) in 353 with a black ink-soaked brush inserted inside her vagina."@en ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
