    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Sculpture Writing - Woman\" realized by Li Xinmo in 2018 at the Swedish Museum. It consists of the characters of the Fahua Sutra the artist rewrites on a 30 meters long paper scroll. The long volume of the Fahua Sutra in her handwriting is hanged in the museum space, and she began to write in an ancient ceremony."@en ;
