<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/76> a ns3:Q215627 ;
    ns2:P103 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q7850> ;
    ns2:P106 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q15095148>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q2914170> ;
