    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU Understanding the Twelve Beauty of Jinling (林黛玉、薛宝钗...)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the musicalligraphy performance entitled \"Understanding the Twelve Beauty of Jinling \" (Lingwu jinling shi'er jin cha 领悟金陵十二金钗) which took place at the Yulan Grand Theatre of Dongguan, on November, 25, 2017. In this performance, Pu Lieping together with other two calligraphers Wang Xiaoming 王晓明and Wang Yong 王勇painted in black ink the twelve names  of the “Twelve Beauties of Jinling” (Jinling shi’er chai 金陵十二钗) of the work “Dream of the Red Chamber” (Honglou Meng 红楼梦), a novel composed by Cao Xueqin 曹雪芹 (1710 - 1765) in the middle of the 18th century. "@en ;
