    ns2:P9302 <http://w3id.org/write/thesaurus/great_seal_script> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 1 With These Hands (《这双手》)" ;
    ns1:description "CWU 1 features the main text of the work \"Mit diesen Händen\" by Huang Miaozi. The artist wrote seven lines of characters in an archaic seal script inspired by the Shang-Zhou bronzes. This text draws inspiration from the poem \"Mit diesen Händen\" by German writer Heinrich Böll, translated by Hao Dazheng. At the end of the poem, written in seal script, the calligrapher Huang Miaozi added two lines in regular script: \"A few sentences from the German Heinrich Böll's posthumous work With These Hands translated in 1992 by Hao Dazheng. (Huang) Miaozi wrote them using the scripts of the Shang and of the Zhou.\""@en ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1358981>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q208045> ;
    ns1:hasCalligraphicLine true ;
    ns1:hasCharacterForm <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q178528> ;
    ns1:hasColophon true ;
    ns1:hasSignificance "Meaningful writing" ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/868> ;
    ns1:madeUsingTool <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q614467> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 64 ;
    ns1:relatedUnit <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/867> ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation " A few sentences from the German Heinrich Böll's posthumous work \"With These Hands\" translated in 1992 by Hao Dazheng. (Huang) Miaozi wrote them using the scripts of the Shang and of the Zhou. (Colophon)"@en,
        """You have washed these hands millions of times\r
and they are always clean, pure, innocent.\r
Nobody has been afraid to clasp them.\r
though it was with these hands\r
that you placed deadly grenades into the launcher.\r
(Translation by Barrass, 2002 p. 178)"""@en,
        " 德国海因利希·伯尔遗作《用这双手》的几句; 一九九二年郝大铮译, 苗子以商周文字书之。(Colophon)"@zh,
        """这双手\r
你曾洗过一百万遍\r
而且总是干净纯洁清白\r
没有人害怕将它握住\r
虽然你曾用它\r
把致人死命的榴弹\r
向发生器的炮口装填。\r
(Barrass, 2002 p. 277)\r
"""@zh,
        """這雙手\r
你曾洗過一百萬遍\r
而且總是乾淨純潔清白\r
沒有任何人害怕將它握住\r
雖然你曾用它\r
把致人死命的榴彈\r
向發生器的炮口裝填"""@zh,
        "Déguó Hǎiyīnlìxī · Bó'ěr yí zuò “Yòng zhè shuāng shǒu” de jǐ jù yījiǔjiǔ'èr nián Hǎo Dàzhēng yì Miáozǐ yǐ Shāng Zhōu wénzì shū zhī (Colophon)"@zh-Latn,
        """Zhè shuāng shǒu\r
nǐ céng xǐ guò yī bǎi wàn biàn\r
érqiě zǒng shì gānjìng chúnjié qīngbái\r
méiyǒu rén hàipà jiāng tā wòzhù\r
suīrán nǐ céng yòng tā\r
bǎ zhì rén sǐ mìng de liúdàn\r
xiàng fāshēngqì de pàokǒu zhuāngtián."""@zh-Latn .

