    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU The Heart Sutra in Chaos Script at the Brooklyn Museum (《心经》)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the artwork created by Wang Dongling on November 7, 2015 for the performance \"The Heart Sutra in Chaos Script at the Brooklyn Museum\" (乱书《心经》现场书写纽约布鲁克林博物馆). Wang Dongling writes the 268 characters of the Heart Sutra in Chaos Script (luan shu 乱书), making the characters mostly unrecognizable."@en ;
