    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance which took place on the occasion of the \"Edge of The Earth\" - Asian Contemporary Art Invitation Exhibition (“De zhi yuan” - Yazhou dangdai yishu kaimu \"地之缘\" - 亚洲当代艺术開幕) held in Hangzhou, China, in November 2003. Wang Dongling wrote in cursive script some lines belonging to the first chapter of the Zhuangzi on propylene panels with white acrylic paint."@en ;
