    ns1:description """Chen Zijin (b. 1966) is  Associate Professor at China Academy of Art ( CAA;  Zhongguo Meishu Xueyuan) in Hangzhou, China. He is also an independent curator and Director and Chief Curator of the Sanshang Contemporary Art Museum (San shang dangdai yishu guan 三尚当代艺术馆). He was the person in charge of the 2016 National Art Fund-funded project.\r
His main research fields include social aesthetic education and community public cultural service system construction, public art planning, book editing and design."""@en ;
