    ns1:description """Wang Dongling Solo Exhibition is part of the exhibition cycle titled "Decanter Ink, Hangzhou Cross Year Exhibition 2011-2012" that was held at the Sanshang Contemporary Art Museum (San shang dangdai yishu guan 三尚当代艺术馆) in Hangzhou from December 19, 2011 to June 1, 2012.  This exhibition cycle included solo exhibitions of six contemporary artists: Zhang Hao 张浩, Wang Tiande 王天德, Hua Jun 花俊, Guan Huaibin 管怀宾, Huang Jun 黄骏 and Wang Dongling 王冬龄.The Wang Dongling's Solo Exhibition (Heibai zhi shang / Wang Dongling  黑白至上/王冬龄) was held from May 13  to 23, 2012.\r
"""@en ;
