    ns1:description "Xu Jiang is president, professor, and doctoral advisor of the China Academy of Art; vice chairman of the China Artists Association; vice chairman of the China Oil Painting Association; chairman of the Zhejiang Federation of Literary and Art Circles; and chairman of the Zhejiang Artists’ Association. He writes extensively on art. Xu Jiang graduated from the  Department of oil painting at the China National Academy of Art in 1982, and later studied in Hamburg, Germany. "@en ;
