    ns1:description """Fan Di'an is the former Director (2005–2014) of National Art Museum of China (NAMOC), Beijing, and Director of the China Artists Association (Zhongguo meishujia xiehui 中国美术家协会) since 2014. Fan curated a wide range of exhibitions in institutions in China and around the world showcasing various aspects of Chinese art, from traditional to contemporary. These exhibitions often explored themes such as cultural identity, societal change, and artistic innovation.\r
"""@en ;
