    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 1 Olympic Beijing (中国奥运 + seals)" ;
    ns1:description """This Calli-Writing Unit is composed of four traditional Chinese characters "Zhongguo Aoyun 中國奧運" that stands for "China Olympic Games". The red characters are written in traditional form and regular script (kaishu 楷书) from left to right and top-to-buttom. They are placed inside a red frame with a double outline, recalling a modern-day seal. \r
Under this frame,  there are three black seal/tags: \r
1. the official logo of the Beijing Olympic Games  that is the stylized shape of a human being, originated from the character "Jing 京 (capital)", in reference to the city of Beijing. Differently from the official red logo, this one has a black background;\r
2. the tag "Kwanyin" in Latin letters;\r
3. the non-simplified Chinese tag "guan 觀"."""@en ;
