<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1185> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P1480 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q60070514> ;
    ns2:P186 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3055935>,
