    ns1:description "This sculpture by Qiu Zhenzhong was exhibited at the Venice Art Biennale. It features fluid, calligraphic lines crafted from black, metallic materials. The abstract forms twist and loop intricately, evoking the sinuous lines of Chinese calligraphy. The piece conveys a sense of movement, plasticity, and rhythm, as if the calligraphic lines have been brought to life in a three-dimensional form, blending art and nature harmoniously." ;
