    ns1:description "\"Why Are You Worried?\" is a large-scale ink work realized by Luo Qi in 1992, and presented by Luo Qi on the occasion of the \"First Exhibition of Calligraphyism\". This artwork features a large, dynamic mix of brushstrokes in various thicknesses and sizes, creating a vibrant composition carrying a strong abstract charge and energy. " ;
