    ns1:description "In the Series of \"iPad Works\" ( iPad 书写, 2021-ongoing), the artist Wang Dongling expanded his artistic repertoire using iPad and Apple pencil as tools to create calligraphy. The artwork “Filling the World with Love” (Rang shijie chongman ai 让世界充满爱, 2021) by Wang Dongling represents one of the first Chinese calligraphic works using iPad innovative technologies." ;
