    ns1:description "\"Born from Thirst for Love, iPad Works, 2021\" is a digital artwork created using an iPad. This piece,  measuring 1668px × 2388px, reflects the theme of intense desire and longing for love, visually rendered through expressive, fluid strokes and vivid, emotional colors. The artwork  combines the text in Chinese and the photograph of Marta Graham. This artwork is included in the series of iPad Works and  highlights Wang Dongling's exploration of modern tools to convey timeless human emotions." ;
