    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 \"Vagina Font\" Calligraphy (unknown) " ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Vagina Font\" Calligraphy (\"bi - 体” 书法)\". Sun Ping assists his collaborator Luo Shan as she executes calligraphy using a brush dipped in red ink inserted inside her vagina. Her movements attempt to reproduce Chinese characters, resulting in different characters (almost illegible) that resemble a wild cursive script style. "@en ;
