    ns1:description "This conceptual photograph attests the performance \"Brush Strokes\" in which Wu Wei uses the brush to \"caress\" the body of a naked woman.  The colors of the photograph are similar to traditional calligraphy, but are used in a new way:  the handle of the brush is black like ink, the bristels are white like paper, and the mattress where the woman is lying is red like seal(s). The photograph is composed of nine frames of the performance. "@en ;
