    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 X-Evolution (X-semi-planned)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is composed of an X combined with a red “TT” seal, which together form the tag “TxT”. The main X is visually articulated into three additional X forms, creating a repeated and interconnected configuration. The X begins to exhibit a brushstroke effect at the end of the stroke, introducing a more fluid and gestural quality into the otherwise straight and controlled structure. This combination produces a hybrid visual language, merging the brushstroke qualities associated with kaishu with the Roller/Straight features of graffiti writing, accompanied by two red tag/seal elements."@en ;
