    ns1:description "This CWU is composed of an X combined with a red “TT” seal, which together form the tag “TxT”. The main X is visually articulated into three additional X forms, creating a repeated and interconnected configuration. The composition resembles a calligraphic inscription executed with brush and ink, while retaining the regular and controlled characteristics of the regular script (kaishu). It is accompanied by a single red tag/seal, which further reinforces its calligraphic visual language."@en ;
