    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/173.jpg> ;
    ns1:derivesFrom <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/170> ;
    ns1:description """In this conceptual photograph, Wu Wei holds the brush tightly in his hand as to reproduce a kind of masturbation. The brush is no longer the tool for calligraphy, but it becames the passive subject of the performance and a "tool of pleasure" for the performer. The colors of the photograph are similar to traditional calligraphy, but are used in a new way:  the handle of the brush is black like ink, the bristels are black and white like ink on paper, and the background of the photograph is red like seal(s). \r
The performance produces other similar conceptual photographs of different moments of the performing act."""@en ;
