    ns1:description "East and West, past and present is a calligraphic work realized by Zhang Aiguo in 2024. The artist presents the four characters 东西今古 in the middle. Their meaning is \"East and West, past and present\" (dong xi jin gu 东西今古) combining together spatial and temporal axes. " ;
