    ns1:description "Tracing the Origin XV_001 is one of the artworks included in the series \"Tracing the Origin\" (2000-2016) by the artist Cui Fei. This installation features dozens of thin copper wires pinned directly onto a wall, creating a sprawling array of delicate, three-dimensional lines. Each wire curves and twists in a manner reminiscent of calligraphic strokes, capturing a sense of fluid movement and organic growth without any linguistic significance." ;
