    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 A Neon Calligraphy Series: Sotheby's (素思碧寺)" ;
    ns1:description "From the English name of the corporation (CWU 1), the artist transliterates the syllabic sounds into Mandarin Chinese. “Sotheby’s” is transliterated into four Chinese characters (Susibisi 素思碧寺), chosen for their phonetic proximity to the English pronunciation and for the meaning of each one, which will be retranslated in the lower register (CWU 3) . In the background of the artwork, these characters were repeated several times. Behind each of the five panels, plexiglas sheets are etched with repeated vertical columns of these 4 same characters. " ;
