    ns1:description "This artwork was created during the TENG Ensemble's digital performance entitled: \"Heaven, Earth, Mankind and Unity (天地人合)\" realized on September 2, 2021 by the TENG company and recorded in the concert hall of the Singapore Chinese Culture Centre. It is an excerpt from the poem \"Spring Blossoms on a Moonlit Night\" (Chunjiang hua yueye 春江花月夜) by Zhang Ruoxu 张若虚 (c. 660-c. 720), specifically the line: \"Yue zhao hua lin jie si xian 月照花林皆似霰\" (The Moonlight Shines upon Dewy Petals, Glimmering like White Pearls) realized by the female calligrapher Grace Chen Liang 陈亮 (b.1974)." ;
