    ns1:description "Stone Path (2008) is a carved stone pathway realized by Xu Bing at the Staatliche Kunstsammlungen Dresden, Germany Dresden. Xu Bing narrates a well-known poem by Su Shi 苏轼 (1037-1101) of the Song Dynasty (960-1279), entitled “Recalling the Old Days at Mianchi in the Same Rhymes as Ziyou's Poem” (He Zi You mianchi huaijiu 和子由渑池怀旧) adopting his Square Word Calligraphy." ;
