    ns1:description "The \"Thereafter: Wang Tiande Art Exhibition\" opened on July 31 at the Xu Wei Art Museum in Shaoxing. This exhibition is the largest of Wang Tiande's career and features 67 works across painting, calligraphy, photography, installation, sculpture, and 3D printing. The artworks are arranged in seven thematic chapters, exploring how art can bridge the past and future. " ;
