        <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2065_4.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2  Dialogue of Heaven: Artificial Intelligence Converses with Qu Yuan (《天问》- regular script)" ;
    ns1:description "CWU 2 consists of the same passages from Qu Yuan’s Questions to Heaven (Tianwen 天问) presented in CWU 1. Unlike the calligraphic transcription of the first unit, the text is rendered through a computer-generated regular script (kaishu) font. Displayed in red against a black background, it preserves the traditional Chinese characters and the conventional vertical layout, being read from top to bottom and from right to left. Throughout the video, each section of “Questions to Heaven” reappears sequentially after the completion of an AI-generated response (CWU 3), establishing a visual and textual bridge between the manually written source text and its digital transcription." ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
