        <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/2065_4_HR.png> ;
    ns1:isUnitOf <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2064> ;
    ns1:numberOfCharacters 1553 ;
    ns1:relatedUnit <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2066>,
        <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2363> ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """Elder Yu emerged from the belly of Gun.\r
What caused the miracle and metamorphosis?\r
Succeeding his father, Yu shouldered the task and successfully completed the mission. How did he continue his father’s work with a different plan of action?\r
If the deepest depths hid the source of the flood, how did he stop the flow?\r
He divided the earth into the Nine Regions. How did he surround them with earth walls?\r
Why did the winged dragon score the earth? \r
Why do rivers pass to the sea?\r
What parts of the work were Gun’s planning? \r
What parts were Yu’s work?\r
(Translation by Gopal Sukhu 2017: 96)"""@en,
        """伯禹愎鮌，夫何以变化？\r
纂就前绪，遂成考功。\r
何续初继业，而厥谋不同？\r
洪泉极深，何以窴之？\r
地方九则，何以坟之？\r
河海应龙，何尽何历？\r
鮌何所营，禹何所成？\r
[...]"""@zh,
        """伯禹愎鮌，夫何以變化？\r
纂就前緒，遂成考功。\r
何續初繼業，而厥謀不同？\r
洪泉極深，何以窴之？\r
地方九則，何以墳之？\r
河海應龍，何盡何歷？\r
鮌何所營，禹何所成？\r
[...]"""@zh,
        """Bó Yǔ bì gǔn, fū héyǐ biànhuà? \r
Zuǎn jiù qián xù, suì chéngkǎo gōng. Héxùchū jì yè, ér jué móu bùtóng? \r
Hóng quán jí shēn, héyǐ tián zhī? \r
Dìfāng jiǔ zé, héyǐ fén zhī? \r
Hé hǎi yīng lóng, hé jǐn hé lì? \r
Gǔn hé suǒ yíng, Yǔ hé suǒ chéng? [...]"""@zh-Latn ;
    ns1:vectorisedOrDigitised true .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2066> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P1480 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q5727902> ;
    ns2:P180 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q11660> ;
    ns2:P282 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q8201> ;
    ns2:P407 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q7850> ;
    ns2:P462 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23444> ;
    ns2:P9302 <http://w3id.org/write/thesaurus/running_script> ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2066.jpg> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 3  Dialogue of Heaven: Artificial Intelligence Converses with Qu Yuan (AI-generated running script)" ;
    ns1:description "CWU 3 consists of the AI-generated responses to Qu Yuan’s “Questions to Heaven” (Tianwen 天问). Unlike CWU 1 and CWU 2, which reproduce the original text by Qu Yuan, this unit introduces new content generated through artificial intelligence in response to the poet’s ancient questions. The text is presented in a running-cursive script (xingcao) modelled on the calligraphic style of Mi Fu (1051-1107), the Northern Song master celebrated for his fluid and expressive brushwork. Displayed in white against a black background, the characters emerge stroke by stroke in real time, visualising both the process of writing and the operation of algorithmic text generation. As each response unfolds, the work transforms the AI system into a contemporary interlocutor, creating a dialogue across historical periods and media while foregrounding questions of authorship, agency, and the relationship between human and machine-generated writing." ;
    ns1:directionality "Traditional" ;
    ns1:hasBackgroundColour <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q23445>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3142> ;
