    ns1:description "Manuscript of Nature VIII_III (2016) by Cui Fei is a triptych made from thorns, with three panels measuring 32 x 62 cm each. The thorns create an abstract, tactile surface that feels both fragile and defensive. The repeated format invites a slow, page-like reading, as if nature were writing through material traces rather than language. " ;
