    ns2:P973 <https://www.qin-feng.com/civilization-1/c7n4h8g4yy2g853fiebd131rc60p66> ;
    ns1:description "Civilization Landscape (2012) is a monumental panoramic painting measuring 4.5 × 9 m that reinterprets the tradition of Chinese landscape painting through abstraction and gestural mark-making. Executed in oil on canvas, the work presents a dynamic field of sweeping black forms and layered textures that evoke mountains and geological formations without depicting a specific site. Its monumental scale immerses the viewer in an expansive visual environment, transforming the landscape into a meditation on the relationship between nature, civilization, and contemporary cultural change. As shown for the works included in the Civilization Landscape series, Qin Feng emphasizes the spontaneous energy of nature through expressive brushwork, translating the vitality of traditional ink painting into a contemporary visual language." ;
