    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 3 Art for the People for The Met (seals/QRcodes) " ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is composed of five read “seals” that surround the English writings of the artworks entitled \"Art for the People for The Met\" by Xu Bing. These seals, that in the ancient Chinese literati tradition represent the sign(s) of the artist, are actually QR codes that the audience can scan to read further on The Met’s website. The insertion of the QRcodes in this work is a reflection on the importance of the web technologies to identifies the individuals in the digital and social media age, but also to generate connections and amplifies the human knowledge. " ;
