    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 2 DRAWSHINE Logo (妆写)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the two characters \"zhuang xie 妆写\" (Drawshine) in the left part of the DRAWSHINE logo. The digital font used for the characters recalls the regular script style (kaishu 楷书) of writing with its varying thicknesses. These two characters that composed the brand name do not exist as a meaningful word, but individually \"zhuang  妆\" means to apply makeup /to beautify, and \"xie 写\" means to write. " ;
