<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2506> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
    ns2:P282 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q41670> ;
    ns2:P407 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1860> ;
    ns2:P462 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q943> ;
    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 3 DRAWSHINE Logo (DRAWSHINE)" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU consists of the word "DRAWSHINE" written in Latin capital letters at the bottom left of the Drawshine logo. The English brand name, Drawshine, is rendered in a custom typographic style that visually complements the Chinese characters "zhuangxie 妆写", just above them.\r
Functionally, this unit serves as a bridge between traditional Chinese cultural symbolism (A COSA TI RIFERISCI?) and the international market, allowing non-Chinese audiences to access the brand identity while maintaining conceptual continuity with the original (CHINESE?) characters. The typography (DI QUALE TIPO?) reinforces the brand’s global orientation, elegance, and refinement, ensuring that the textual element of the logo (SOLO QUELLI DI QUESTA CWU O IN GENERALE?) communicates both the name and the ethos of DRAWSHINE in a manner that is legible, aesthetically harmonious, and culturally resonant.""" ;
