    ns1:description "\"Dust\" is part of Song Chen’s series titled \"Earth Script\", realized in 2018. The work presents a graphic variant of the character for 'dust' (chen 尘), rendered in the rare form 薼. The content implied by this character is influenced by Buddhist thought and reflects on the essence of existence: “life emerges from soil and ultimately returns to it, dust to dust, earth to earth” (artist's interview 2025). The medium foregrounds ‘dust’ as both substance and concept/message of transience and impermanence. " ;
