    ns1:description "Series of five garments, inspired by Tong Yangtze’s calligraphic works. All garments aim  to represent the fluidity of the movement through an ensemble of strips made of three different types of silk fabrics, whose silhouette is taken from the famous calligrapher’s strokes. On the strips are then found enlarged prints of the abovementioned calligraphic lines. With this series the designer explores what she defines as the “complicated and strong” strokes and movements of Tong Yangtze."@en ;
