    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 3 Eye Charts (numbers)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU consists of the numerical values displayed along both sides of the eye chart associated with each row of characters. As in a standard eye chart, these values provide a reference scale, allowing each line to be identified according to its corresponding acuity level. In this work, the numbers function as a familiar visual guide, preserving the conventional structure of an eye chart while supporting the viewer's interpretation of the progressively characters which are less and less recognizable." ;
