    ns1:description "This artwork, executed in August 2022 by Shao Yan belongs to a series of works created during that month. For this work, Shao Yan uses a syringe to inject black ink on the Chinese white bottle vase (composed of a elongated oval body and a double concave thin neck) which is located on a rotating base. Shao Yan’s aim is to adapt the lines and marks created by the ink jet with the oval body and the concave thin neck of the vessel."@en ;
