    ns1:description "This installation was made by Zhang Qiang in 2001 in a small mountain area of Shangdong. Zhang Qiang with his female counterpart Chen Wei 陈蔚, paints traces of ink on geometric shapes made of plaster. Then, he places them between the branches of trees and between the cracks of a white stone wall. This installation is a reflection of the relationship between man and nature. "@en ;
