    ns2:P856 <http://www.qiuzhijie.com/worksleibie/calligraphy/2017%20zhijiage/ru.htm> ;
    ns1:description "In this artwork, Qiu Zhijie reproduces four characters representing a Daoist talisman, carving on a layer of concrete. After the plate is dry, the inscription was printed on paper by rubbing with ink, and a new layer of concrete was poured, upon which a new set of characters was then inscribed. The style of the characters is formal, recalling the seal style and a type of decorative style also present in ancient utensils. It could also represent a real seal." ;
