<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/498> a ns3:Q7725310 ;
    ns2:P1071 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q34405> ;
    ns2:P1476 "Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J Model - The Divine Brush comes to Jingde Series (张强踪迹学报告 A/J 模型 - 神来景德之笔系列)"@en,
        "张强踪迹学报告 A/J 模型 - 神来景德之笔系列"@zh,
        "Zhāng Qiáng zōngjì xué bàogào A/J móxíng - shén lái jǐng dé zhī bǐ xìliè"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P170 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/100> ;
    ns2:P580 "2018"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns2:P582 "2022"^^xsd:gYear ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/498.jpg> ;
    ns1:description """This series by Zhang Qiang runs from 2018 to 2022. In these four years, Zhang Qiang participates in three different exhibitions that took place at the "Sanbao Ceramic Art Base" of Jingdezhen (景德镇三宝蓬艺术聚落) giving life to calligraphic performances. The female counterpart is holding and rotating some ceramic objects (of different shapes and sizes) while Zhang Qiang, looking away, writes on the objects with a particular glaze used to decorate ceramics, leaving traces on them. During the performance, the female counterpart freely chooses background music from her mobile phone. At the end of the performance, the ceramics are donated to the sponsors and organizers of the exhibition, while the remaining part is added to Zhang Qiang's private collection. On the ceramics there is often a "red sign", representing the two characters of the name of the female counterpart. \r
The first exhibition takes place in October 27, 2018, the second from 19 to 29 January, 2019 and the third in June, 2022.\r
In 2018, Zhang Qiang did three performances, collaborating with three different female counterparts: 1) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 1 (Zhan Yuanyuan) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 1 (詹苑源)]; 2) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 2 (Ren Yixin) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 2 (任一心) 模型]; 3) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report (Xie Xueke) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 3 (谢雪珂) 模型].\r
In the 2019 Exhibition Zhang Qiang did five performances: 1) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 4 (Gu Yun) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 4 (顾韵) 模型]; 2) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 5  (Zhang Qingzhi) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 5(张青枝) 模型]; 3) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 6 (Guan Wenru) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 6 (关文茹) 模型 ]; 4) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 7 (Gao Ya) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 7 (高雅) 模型 ]; 5) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 8 (Jane Yijing) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 8 (简怡静) 模型 ].\r
In 2022, Zhang Qiang did other three performances: 1) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 9 (Wang Lina) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 9 (王丽娜) 模型]; 2) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 10 (Zhou Wenqian) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 10 (周文倩) 模型]; 3) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 11 (Gu Tiantian) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 11 (郭天天) 模型]. """@en ;
