    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 5 (Zhang Qingzhi) Model - The Divine Brush comes to Jingde [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 5 (张青枝) 模型 - 神来景德之笔]\" which took place in 2019 at the Sanbaopeng Ceramic Art Base of Jingdezhen (Jingdezhen sanbao peng yishu juluo 景德镇三宝蓬艺术聚落). It consists of \"decorative traces\" written by Zhang Qiang with the brush on some ceramic objects, using a particular glaze (you liao 釉料) traditionally used to decorate Chinese ceramics."@en ;
