    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 3 Her Mountain (救救我、求求你、别杀我、别S我)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the installation \"Her Mountain (Ta shan 她山)\". It consists of the characters written by Wu Xixia inside an inflatable hermetic sphere during the performance \"Darling\" in which Wu Xixia performs in front of a building called \"Darling\". The building was covered with red ribbons, which spread all the way to the inflatable ball. Wu Xixia writes sentences like: \"jiu jiu wo 救救我\" (help me); \"qiuqiu ni 求求你\" (I beg you), \"bie sha wo 别杀我\" (don't kill me); \"bie S wo  别S我\" (don't fuck me), etc. inside the hermetic sphere. The female body becomes an object of desire and \"objectification\" under the male gaze. Passers, by watching the performance, thus become part of the performance itself."@en ;
