    ns1:description "These seventeen stones are used during the performance \"Luo Qi and Collegium Musicum Almae Matris - Musicalligraphy Performance (Luo Qi yu Boluoniya daxue yuedui - shufa yinyue biaoyan 洛齐与博洛尼亚大学乐队 - 书法音乐表演)\". These are Carrara marble stones on which Luo Qi wrote characters with black ink. On each stone Luo Qi writes two to six characters from the \"Orchid Pavilion Preface\" (Lanting Xu 兰亭序). "@en ;
