    ns1:description "This artwork is made during the performance \"Anatomy of Posidonia\" realized by Echo Morgan in occasion of the 3rd Edition of the \"Territori - Ibiza Performance Art Festival\" (17-25 September, 2022) which takes place in Ibiza, Spain. The artwork consists on a long scroll of paper eleven meters long. The artwork consists of traces and marks leaved by the artist's hair which are dipped in a compound made of chlorophyll powder mixed with seawater.  With various body movements, accompanied by some verses and vocal sounds, the artist becomes a brush and leaves \"imprints\" and marks of her body's passage on the sheet."@en ;
