    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 1 \"Vagina Font\" Calligraphy (笔墨之道)" ;
    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the performance \"Vagina Font\" Calligraphy (\"bi - 体” 书法)\". Sun Ping assists his collaborator Luo Shan as she executes calligraphy using a brush dipped in black ink inserted inside her vagina.  Her movements attempt to reproduce Chinese characters, resulting in four running script characters: \"The Way of Writing\" (bimo zhi dao 笔墨之道)"@en ;
