    ns2:P856 <https://jessieyingyinggong.com/> ;
    ns1:description "This artwork is part of the \"Enfolding\" series made by Jessie Yingying Gong in 2019. It represents the Chinese character \"an 安\"(safe) written in regular script mixed with its Nushu script form. The character is designed on the computer first, by cutting each character (of the pair) into vertical strips, then stitching the strips one next to the other. By folding the sheet several times, an optical effect is obtained in which the two characters appear to join each other. This artwork is part of the \"Enfolding\" series made by Jessie Yingying Gong in 2019. "@en ;
