    ns1:description "This work was made by Tong Yang-tze and used in the ballet performance \"Cursive I\". The work is brought down from above onto a panel and placed in the center of the stage. The dancer Chou Chang-ning dances in front of the work realized on a panel positioned in the middle of the stage. Her long black sleeves follow the movement of the blank ink in the air, while the body of the dancer emulates the lines of the character itself."@en ;
