    ns2:P571 "2008-01-12"^^xsd:date ;
    ns1:description "On January 12, 2008 Pu Lieping, the day before the \"Music and Calligraphy\" performance, inspired by the music composed by the three students of the Gulf Coast University in Florida, made a preparatory draft on a wrapping paper from the Polo Ralph Lauren brand. The characters, which are broken down and created with a pen, are inspired by the inscriptions on oracle bones. These characters are: shui 水 (water) zhi 止 (to/only) mu 木 (wood) 目 (eye). Animal figures can also be glimpsed in the work, such as deer heads. The lines that make up the draft can be both vertical and horizontal, as if to reproduce the movements of the elements of nature."@en ;
