    ns1:description "\"Diary\" is one of the artwork included in the \"Signatures Series\" (1988-1989) by Qiu Zhenzhong. In this artwork he transcribes his own name, his grandmother's name, and other phrases repetitively on the same sheet every day from September 7, 1988, to June 26, 1989. The arrangement of elements is entirely random, and the artist explores themes of repetition and ritual." ;
