    ns1:description "Yan Binghui (b. in Tianjin in 1956) is Professor at the Tianjin Academy of Fine Arts, member of the Chinese Calligraphers Association, Executive Director of the Chinese Modern Painting and Calligraphy Society, and member of the Chinese Artists Association. He was one of the organizer  together with Pu Lieping, Wei Ligang, and Chu Sang of the 1999 exhibition \"Bashu Parade\"." .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1395> a ns3:Q4502142 ;
