    ns2:P1476 "Brushed Voices: Calligraphy in Contemporary China"@en ;
    ns2:P1640 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2048> ;
    ns2:P276 <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q117374330>,
