    ns2:P571 "2003"^^xsd:gYear ;
    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/1707_1.jpg>,
        <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/1707_2.jpg>,
        <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/1707_3.jpg>,
        <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/1707_4.jpg> ;
    ns1:description """Status VII consists of 48 sheets, each measuring 42 × 38 cm. The artist creates dynamic structures composed of abstract lines similar to calligraphic strokes that evoke the visual appearance of Chinese characters without forming readable text. \r
Each of them presents a dense configuration of interwoven black lines concentrated within a compact pictorial field, as the brushstrokes overlap and intersect, generating a sense of tension and movement that guides the viewer's eye across the surface.\r
The work investiages the status/condition of writing beyond its linguistic function, transforming calligraphic marks into autonomous and pure visual form of expression. These works exemplify the fusion of calligraphy and abstraction, showing the wide range of expressive potential of the calligraphic line, its plasticity and rhythm.  Building on these works, in 2024 Qiu created a group of iron sculptures entitled Status (Zhuangtai 状态), translating the movement and structural logic of the brushstrokes into three-dimensional space. """ ;
