    ns2:P571 "2012"^^xsd:gYear ;
    ns2:P608 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1720> ;
    ns1:description "From the video piece “Not Too Late\" (2010), Feng Mengbo created a series of ink and mixed-media paintings and works on paper, capturing isolated moments from the video and transferring them to canvas and paper. \"Not Too Late - Orchid Pavilion Preface“ is part of this series. It is characterized by the transcription of an excerpt of the Orchid Pavilion Preface written with ink on one frame of the original video. This work together with the others of the same series were first displayed in the exhibition \"Not Too Late - Recent Works by Feng Mengbo\" at Chambers Fine Art Gallery in Beijing in 2012, and subsequently in New York in 2013." ;
