    ns1:description """Civilization 2 is a  folded panel with abstract ink brushwork and Arabic calligraphy realized by Qin Feng in 2004, part of the series entitled Civilization Landscape. The text is written in Arabic, with an expressive and fluid script, while the abstract black ink splashes and strokes create a dynamic contrast.\r
Inspired by his upbringing in Xinjiang, a multicultural intersection of the silk roads,  Qin Feng has incorporated Chinese, Uighur, Arabic, and Russian language into his "Civilization Landscape Series".\r
In his "Civilization Landscape Series", Qin Feng emphasizes cultural contrast through the use of tea (symbolizing Asia) and coffee (symbolizing the West) as background.""" ;
