    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2083.jpg> ;
    ns1:description """“White Orchid: Exotic Goddesses - Wen Tingyun” is part of a project realized by Chu Chu between 2017 and 2020 and belongs to the series "Material Immaterial" (Wu fei wu 物非物).  The project began as black-and-white photographs of everyday objects, such as magnolia flowers, which the artist kept in her studio in Hangzhou. Over time, Chu Chu enriched these images by adding delicate characters written vertically in white and soft colored ink, such as purple and pink, arranged to resemble the composition of the gentle flower petals falling  over the photographed subjects. In this work, as in others from the series, the artist transforms ordinary objects into contemplative symbols of life's impermanence. The artist invites viewers to rediscover the overlooked beauty of things we tend to consider unimportant, such as withered flowers.\r
 """ ;
