        <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2091> ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """"One-hearted"  by Wang Wei of the Tang Dinasty\r
\r
When those red berries come in springtime,\r
Flushing on your southland branches,\r
Take home an armful, for my sake,\r
As a symbol of our love."""@en,
        """唐﹕王維 相思\r
紅豆生南國﹐春來發幾枝。\r
願君多採擷﹐此物最相思。"""@zh,
        """唐﹕王维 相思\r
