        <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2089>,
        <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2091> ;
    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """Come to Bairui Temple for poetry reading at dusk, welcomed and appreciated guest,\r
Gleeful lady, high spirited feeling, \r
Like having orchid and sensual concubine. \r
Vast heaven oh! Deep shore, poetising at dusk is a higher blessing than jade. \r
Oh! Love, floating and soaring waves of the heart, sing and dance my happiness.\r
"""@en,
        """晚作詩來得拜睿寺﹐ 客目迎斯頗令嘆。\r
婦樂形昂猶﹐受似攬得菩蘭妾色。\r
太闊泓岸啊﹗暮賦而福邁賽珂。\r
愛思啊﹐心波翱浮﹐謳舞而樂福。\r
\r
 ( 以 Witter Bynner 的唐詩英譯本 Jade Mountain 之英語讀音的同聲漢字譯回成中文 )"""@zh,
        """晚作诗来得拜睿寺，客目迎斯令颇叹。\r
妇乐形昂犹，受似揽得菩兰妾色。\r
太阔泓岸啊﹗暮赋而福迈赛珂。\r
爱思啊，心波翱翔，讴舞而乐福。"""@zh,
        """Wǎn zuòshī láidé bài ruì sì, kè mù yíng sī pō lìng tàn.\r
 Fù lè xíng áng yóu, shòu sì lǎn dé pú lán qiè sè. \r
Tài kuò hóng àn a﹗mù fù ér fú mài sài kē. \r
Ài sī a, xīn bō áo fú, ōu wǔ ér lè fú."""@zh-Latn .

