    ns1:attributedTitle "CWU 4 Retranslation & Rewriting of Tang Poem no.1 (Come to Baihua Temple)" ;
    ns1:description """This CWU presents a further English translation. It translates to English Gu Wenda’s phonetical transliteration into Chinese characters (CWU 3) of the English traslation (CWU 2) of Wang Wei’s poem (CWU 1). In other words, the text undergoes a double linguistic mediation. The English version of Wang Wei’s poem is first phonetically transcribed into Chinese characters (CWU 3). That phonetic Chinese text is then translated back into English.\r
 """ ;
