    ns1:description "This white silk garment was created by Wang Dongling in 2017 for \"The Silk Road Yunshang\" exhibition, held at the Taimiao Art Museum in Beijing in May 2017. The garment is inscribed with black acrylic ink in the luanshu (chaos script) style. Wang Dongling reproduced the text of \"Wandering Beyond\" (Xiaoyao you 逍遥游), the first of the “inner chapter\" (neipian 内篇) of Zhuangzi 庄子."@en ;
