    ns1:description "These artworks are the \"traced\" clothes made during the performance \"Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/C 3 Model - Cicada Wings (张强踪迹学报告 A/C 3 模型 - 蝉翼缥举)\" at the \"Great Exhibition Court\" of the London British Museum in occasion of the \"Amazing Brush - Chinese Modern Calligraphy Exhibition\" (Jingren zhi bi—xiandai Zhongguo shufa zhan 惊人之笔—现代中国书法展). At the end of the performance, the \"traced\" clothes were exhibited in the British Museum."@en ;
