    ns1:description "This CWU is part of Cursive I dance performance. It consists of the character \"pan 磐\" (hard stone) realized by Tong Yang-tze. The dancer Chou Chang-ning dances in front of the work realized on a panel positioned in the middle of the stage. Her long black sleeves follow the movement of the blank ink in the air, while the body of the dancer emulates the lines of the character itself.  "@en ;
