    ns1:description "This long calligraphy was made during the musicalligraphy performance by Luo Qi and Collegium Musicum Almae Matris held at the Library of the University of Bologna dering the opening ceremony of the exhibition \"Luo Qi: Writing Music\" (25/03/2019).  The scroll is composed of two sections: the first one is the transcription of the classical music heard by the calligrapher using the Dunhuang Musical score (Dunhuang qupu 敦煌曲谱); the second one is the transcription of the Orchid Pavilion Preface (Lanting Xu 兰亭序) in running script.  "@en ;
