    ns1:description "This artwork is the result of the performance which took place on the occasion of the \"Edge of The Earth\" - Asian Contemporary Art Invitation Exhibition (“Di zhi yuan” - Yazhou dangdai yishu yaoqing zhan \"地之缘\" - 亚洲当代艺术邀请展) held in Hangzhou, China, in November 2003. Wang Dongling wrote in cursive script some characters belonging to the first chapter of the Zhuangzi on propylene panels with white acrylic paint."@en ;
