    ns2:P1476 "Ink Dance on the West Lake - Dialogue between Calligraphy and Dance (墨舞西湖—书法与舞蹈的对话)"@en,
        "墨舞西湖—书法与舞蹈的对话"@zh,
        "Mò wǔ xīhú—shūfǎ yǔ wǔdǎo de duìhuà"@zh-Latn ;
