    ns1:description """Yumi is among the founding members of the Kwanyin Clan 观音, established in June 2006 in Beijing’s 798 Art District together with Eric Tin (a.k.a. Tin), Quan, and Jer (Jeer).\r
He  took part in the creation of the artworks "Landscape Painting PIC" (Shanshui 山水PIC) and "The Entire World Celebrates" (Putiantongqing (普天同庆). For this piece, commissioned by Adidas for the 2010 FIFA World Cup advertising campaign, Yumi used brush and tempera on a leather football to produce an extreme grey-and-white wildstyle composition based on the two Chinese characters cuju 蹴鞠 (ancient Chinese football)."""@en ;
    ns1:hasCalligraphicTraining "Present (not specified)"@en ;
