        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q8343>,
        <https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q9798> ;
    ns2:P1476 "Ferragina – Cerino Heart Sutra : The Music of the Chinese Calligraphy (塞尔维奥&亚历山得罗：心经 - 中国书法的音乐)"@en,
        "塞尔维奥&亚历山得罗：心经 - 中国书法的音乐"@zh,
        "Sàiěrwéiào & Yàlìshāndéluó: Xīnjīng - Zhōngguó shūfǎ de yīnyuè"@zh-Latn ;
    ns2:P175 <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1237>,
