    ns1:calligrapher <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/526> ;
    ns1:description """“Silencer” (Xiaoyin 消音) is a performance realized by Wu Xixia on July 26, 2023 in occasion of the “Chengdu Biennale Parallel Exhibition” (Chengdu shuang nian zhan pingxing zhan 成都双年展平行展) held from July, 15 to September 17 where the artist writes a series of words in an inflatable sphere and recites them through a loudspeaker, inviting spectators  on site (both kids and adults) to participate.\r
Wu Xi Xia wrote about many women's secrets and the shame that keeps them "silenced". She collected some anonymous and shameful experiences of women not being accepted by society and wrote them into the sphere. Examples of these words/sentences include: "I have a lot of armpit hair" (wo yemao henduo 我腋毛很多); "I wear a pregnancy control device" (wo dai jieyu qi 我戴节育器); "I was divorced" (wo liguo hun 我离过婚); "I am flat chested" (wo pingxiong 我平胸); "I go for breast augmentation" (wo longguo xiong 我隆过胸); "I go for full-body liposuction" (wo quanshen xi zhi 我全身吸脂); "I made pornographic because of my big breasts" (wo yinwei xiong da bei yi yin, wo chanhou inda songchi 我因为胸大被意淫，我产后阴道松弛); "my vagina is loose after giving birth" (wo bei yaoqiu sheng nanhai guangzongyaozu 我被要求生男孩光宗耀祖); "I was raped by her brother" (wo bei qin gege qiangjianguo 我被亲哥哥强奸过), etc. Each time Wu Xixia writes a word or sentence, the spectator is invited to completely cover the words with red spray paint on the external surface of the sphere.\r
Wu Xixia writes these sentences in regular script. In fact, as she explained:\r
"I used my font to write. In fact, I didn’t care whether the writing looked good or not, because I had been recalling the 'silenced memories' I had collected. I had been writing very fast, but at the same time, people outside were also spraying paint on me, and they were covering it very quickly" (Interview 2025).\r
\r
Other similar performances held by Wu Xixia between 2022 and 2023 are: \r
1) “Letter to Mom” (Yu mu shu与母书) realized in 2022 where she writes inside an hermetic plastic sphere some words referring to her mother, inviting the children to calligraph with her on the external surface of the sphere;\r
2) “Opposite/Image” (Dui/Xiang 对/像) realized in 2023 where she is inside a hermetic red cube made of plastic and invites viewers to come closer to trace the outline of their body on the external surface of the cube. In the meantime, Wu Xixia composes the two characters “dui 对” and “xiang 像” on the inner surface of the sphere while observing what happens externally;\r
3) “Confrontation” (Duihua 对话) which takes place at the “17th Macau International Live Art Festival (MIPAF)” (Di shiqi jie Aomen guoji xianchang yishu jie 第十七届澳门国际现场艺术节 - MIPAF) on January 7, 2023 where Wu Xixia begins to write on a red humanoid mannequin with a brush the white characters “human” (ren 人) and “art” (yishu 艺术) to “give life” to it, announcing the beginning of the confrontation (see the archive).""" ;
