    ns1:description "This CWU is part of the TENG Ensemble's digital performance entitled: \"Heaven, Earth, Mankind and Unity (天地人合)\" realized on September 2, 2021 by the TENG company and recorded in the concert hall of the Singapore Chinese Culture Centre. It consists of the two characters jing guan 静观 (observe calmly/mindfulness) realized by the female calligrapher Grace Chen Liang 陈亮  using her left hand on the notes of the piece written by Hua Yanjun, commonly known as Ah Bing 阿炳 (1893 – 1950) “Reflection of the Moon on Erquan Spring” (Er quan ying yue 二泉映月). " ;
