    sch:thumbnailUrl <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/thumbs/2080.jpg> ;
    ns1:description "The series includes: “City” 城市, “Tree whisper” 树语, “Blade” 力身, “White orchid” 白兰花, “Fruit” 果实, “Tools” 工具 and “Containers” 容器. All the artworks of the series were born as photos in black and white of everyday life objects. The aim of the artist is to symbolize the importance of everyday objects as well as emphasizing how they consist of both a material and immaterial part. The immateriality of matter is identified by the spiritual side of objects. The latter depends on us and on the significance of these everyday objects in our lives. From 2010, the artist adds calligraphy to these photos.  Another translation of the title of the series in English is \"Object and Non-Object\". " ;
    ns1:image <https://cloud.ditlab.it/public.php/dav/files/b49pfgPgPXNDFtc/2080_HR.png> ;
    ns1:includesArtwork <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2077>,
