        <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2083>,
        <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/2099> ;
    ns1:notes """Item compiled by Teresa Briatti\r
The translation "Material Immaterial" comes from the title of the exhibition that took place in 2014 in Beijing: https://www.cafa.com.cn/en/news/details/8323120; the translation "Object Non-object" comes from the catalogue “Meigui yu yuelun玫瑰与月轮 / Roses and the Lunar Halo”.""" .

