    ns1:calligrapher <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/100> ;
    ns1:description "This performance takes place on August 7, 1998 at the Shidao Hotel Frontier Beach, Weihai (Shandong Province). This is the first time Zhang Qiang experiences writing on human body. The woman Li Ensu is wearing only a swimsuit and Zhang Qiang covers her swimsuit and body with black ink traces, turning his back to the subject. Although the artist's intent is writing recognizable Chinese characters and sentences, the three-dimensional bumps and movements of the female counterpart transform writing into simple ink traces. "@en ;
