    ns1:description "This artwork is a \"painted\" paper dress that is created during the performance \"Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/B 94 (Cao Rui) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/B 94 (曹蕊) 模型]\". Zhang Qiang introduces the new concept of “conceptual clothing” (guannian fuzhuang 观念服装) (Zhang 2017: 61-62). This is the first time that Zhang Qiang uses dresses for his \"Traceology performances\". For this performance, Zhang Qiang collaborates with Zhao Jingyu 赵泾羽, a Beijing fashion designer specializing in western styles who makes dresses for him out of white calligraphy paper. Her creations are put on by the professional model Cao Rui 曹蕊, who assists Zhang Qiang in his art by allowing him to paint on the paper dresses she is wearing."@en ;
