    ns1:description """This is the arwork created during the performance "Darling" held in 2021 in Macau, in front of a building called “Darling” and then constituting an on-site installation. This artwork was then used as part of the installation "Her Mountain" (Ta shan 她山）exposed in Beijing in 2021 in occasion of the "Wu Xixia  Personal Art Exhibition" (Wu Xixia ge zhan 吴析夏个展 - December 6 to 20, 2021) at the Song Yang Art Museum (Song Yang meishu guan 宋洋美术馆).  Other two inflatable balls originated from other two performances complete the installation.   \r
On this inflatable ball, Wu Xixia wrote expressions, such as "jiu jiu wo 救救我" (help me), "qiuqiu ni 求求你" (I beg you), "bie sha wo 别杀我" (don't kill me), "bie S wo 别S我" (don't fuck me), etc. Writing these words in red color, the artist wants to attract the public audience, giving a feminist message. """@en ;
