    ns1:description "Born in Heilongjiang in 1953, Sun Ping joined the “China Artists Association” (Zhongguo meishu jia xiehui 中国美术家协会) in 1982 and graduated from the “Guangzhou Academy of Fine Arts” (Zhongguo Guangzhou meishu xueyuan 中国广州美术学院) in China in 1987. In 1990 he created the series “Trace” (Henji 痕迹) and in 1991 he created the series “Acupuncture” (Zhenjiu 针灸). In 1993, he participated in the “Travelling Exhibition of Post-1989 Chinese Contemporary Art” (Hou ‘89 Zhongguo dangdai yishu xunhui zhan 后‘89中国当代艺术巡回展) held in Hong Kong and the United States with the painting “Issuing Stocks” (Faxing gupiao 发行股票). In 1998, he participated in the “’98 Asian Modern Art Exhibition” (’98 Yazhou xiandai meishu zhan ‘98亚洲现代美术展). From 1999 to 2000, he participated in the “Cross-Century Rainbow - Gaudy Art Exhibition” (Kua shiji caihong - Yan su yishu zhan 跨世纪彩虹 - 艳俗艺术展) in Tianjin, with “Miss China” (Zhongguo xiaojie 中国小姐). From 1999 to 2002, he founded the magazine “Vision 21” (Shijue 21视觉21)."@en ;
