    ns1:description """This performance took place on the occasion of the "Edge of The Earth" - Asian Contemporary Art Invitation Exhibition (“Di zhi yuan” - Yazhou dangdai yishu yaoqing zhan "地之缘" - 亚洲当代艺术邀请展") held in Hangzhou, China, in November 2003. Wang Dongling wrote in cursive script some lines belonging to the first chapter of the Zhuangzi on propylene panels with white acrylic paint. \r
On the background, there is the huge calligraphy in cursive script entitled "Wandering Beyond: I" (Yi xie "Xiaoyao you" 一写《逍遥游》) realized by Wang Dongling in ink on paper in 2003. Throught this performance, the artist writes some lines of the same text on transparent panels, creating a dialogue between the two artworks, and so between calligraphy and performance art, classical and modern tools/materials, and tradition and innovation."""@en ;
