    ns2:P1476 "Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/C Model (张强踪迹学报告 A/C 模型)"@en,
        "张强踪迹学报告 A/C 模型"@zh,
        "Zhāng Qiáng zōngjì xué bàogào A/C móxíng"@zh-Latn ;
