    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """One builds a house on human territory,\r
yet there is no sound of cart or horse.\r
One asks you how this can be so,\r
but your mind is a distant place, self-absorbed.\r
Picking chrysanthemums under the eastern fence,\r
one pensively views the southern mountains.\r
The mountain air and sunset are beautiful;\r
flying birds return together.\r
There is true meaning in this;\r
desiring argument, one stops and forgets to speak."""@en,
        """結廬在人境,\r
而無車馬喧。\r
問君何能爾？ \r
心遠地自偏。 \r
採菊東籬下， \r
悠然見南山。\r
山氣日夕佳， \r
飛鳥相與還。 \r
此中有真意,\r
欲辯已忘言。 """@zh,
        """结庐在人境,\r
而无车马喧。\r
问君何能尔？\r
心远地自偏。\r
采菊东篱下，\r
悠然见南山。\r
山气日夕佳，\r
飞鸟相与还。\r
此中有真意,\r
欲辩已忘言。"""@zh,
        """jié lú zài rén jìng \r
ér wú chē mǎ xuān\r
wèn jūn hé néng ěr \r
xīn yuǎn dì zì piān\r
cǎi jú dōng lí xià\r
yōu rán jiàn nán shān\r
shān qì rì xī jiā\r
fēi niǎo xiāng yǔ huán\r
cǐ zhōng yǒu zhēn yì\r
yù biàn yǐ wàng yán"""@zh-Latn .

