    ns1:transcriptionAndTranslation """Among the blossoms waits a jug of wine.\r
I pour myself a drink, no loved one near.\r
Then raising my cup, I invite the bright moon\r
and turn to my shadow. We are now three.\r
But the moon doesn’t understand drinking,\r
and my shadow follows my body like a slave.\r
Still, for a time they will be my companions,\r
a passing joy that should last through the spring.\r
I sing and the moon just wavers in the sky;\r
I dance and my shadow whips around like mad.\r
While lucid still, we have such fun together!\r
But stumbling drunk, each staggers off alone.\r
Though bound forever, unfettered we roam\r
till we meet on yonder river of stars."""@en,
        """花間一壺酒，\r
獨酌無相親；\r
舉杯邀明月，\r
對影成三人。\r
月既不解飲，\r
影徒隨我身；\r
暫伴月將影，\r
行樂須及春。\r
我歌月徘徊，\r
我舞影零亂；\r
醒時同交歡，\r
醉後各分散。\r
永結無情遊，\r
相期邈雲漢。"""@zh,
        """花间一壶酒，\r
独酌无相亲；\r
举杯邀明月，\r
对影成三人。\r
月既不解饮，\r
影徒随我身；\r
暂伴月将影，\r
行乐须及春。\r
我歌月徘徊，\r
我舞影零乱；\r
醒时同交欢，\r
醉后各分散。\r
永结无情游，\r
相期邈云汉。"""@zh,
        """Huā jiān yī hú jiǔ,\r
Dú zhuó wū xiāng qīn;\r
Jǔ bēi yāo míng yuè,\r
Duì yǐng chéng sān rén.\r
Yuè jì bù jiě yǐn,\r
Yǐng tú suí wǒ shēn;\r
Zàn bàn yuè jiāng yǐng,\r
Xínglè xū jí chūn.\r
Wǒ gē yuè páihuái,\r
Wǒ wǔ yǐng língluàn;\r
Xǐng shí tóng jiāo huān,\r
Zuì hòu gè fēnsàn.\r
Yǒng jié wúqíng yóu,\r
Xiāng qī miǎo yúnhàn."""@zh-Latn .

<http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/1813> a ns1:CalliWritingUnit ;
