    ns1:description """In this stele the text undergoes a double linguistic mediation of the poem "One-Hearted" (Xiang Si 相思) by Wang Wei. The English translation of Wang Wei’s poem is  phonetically transcribed into Chinese characters (CWU 3). That phonetic Chinese text is then translated back into English (CWU 4).\r
