    ns1:calligrapher <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/100> ;
    ns1:createsArtwork <http://wendang-project.github.io/data/item/503> ;
    ns1:description """This performance took place in 2019 at the Sanbaopeng Ceramic Art Base of Jingdezhen (Jingdezhen sanbao peng yishu juluo 景德镇三宝蓬艺术聚落). The female counterpart Zhang Qingzhi 张青枝 is holding and rotating some ceramic objects (of different shapes and sizes) while Zhang Qiang, looking away, writes on the objects with a particular glaze used to decorate ceramics, leaving traces on them. During the performance, the female counterpart freely chooses background music from her mobile phone.  At the end of the performance, the ceramics (about a dozen in total) are donated to the sponsors and organizers of the exhibition, while the remaining part is added to Zhang Qiang's private collection.  On the ceramics there is often  a "red sign", representing the two characters of the name of the female counterpart "青枝" (Qingzhi).\r
During the same exhibition (from January 19 to 29, 2019) other performances of the same kind also took place: 1) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 4 (Gu Yun) Model [张强踪迹学报告 A/J 4 (顾韵) 模型 ]; 2) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 6 (Guan Wenru) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 6 (关文茹) 模型 ]; 3) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 7 (Gao Ya) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 7 (高雅) 模型 ]; 4) Zhang Qiang's Traceology Report A/J 8 (Jane Yijing) Model [张强踪迹学报告A/J 8 (简怡静) 模型]."""@en ;
