    ns1:description """This Visual Artwork consists in the calligraphic piece realized by Wang Dongling in 2003. Wang Dongling used for the first time the text  "Wandering Beyond" (Xiaoyaoyou 逍遥游) from Zhuangzi. It represents the first iconic monumental calligraphy work of the artist,  measuring 7 x 12 meters long. The writing lines cross each other in a three-dimensional space, with a strong dynamic vision which gives a sense of vitality and movement. Wang transcribed the first chapter of Zhuangzi on several other occasions:\r
- Wandering Beyond: I (Yi xie "Xiaoyao you" 一写 《逍遥游》, 2003), Ink on Paper, 750cm×1250cm;\r
- Wandering Beyond: II (Er xie "Xiaoyao you" 二写《 逍遥游》, 2003), Ink on Paper, 750cm×1000cm;\r
- Wandering Beyond: III (San xie "Xiaoyao you" 三写《逍遥游》), Ink on Paper, 730cm×1785cm; \r
- Wandering Beyond ("Xiaoyao you"《逍遥游》, 365 x 432 cm (in Chaos Script, luanshu), 2015\r
\r
 """@en ;
