    ns1:description "The real driving force behind the Kwanyin Clan’s artistic research is its leader, Task (a.k.a. Tin/EricTin). What he seeks to do is pursue the search for a new aesthetic in which tradition makes modernity, starting from far-western media and art forms to create an identifiably Chinese style, strongly \"sinicized\", yet aesthetically accessible on a global scale. "@en ;
