    ns1:description "Feng Mengbo was born  in Beijing in 1966. He graduated from the Design Department of Beijing School of Arts & Crafts in 1987 and from the Printmaking Department of Central Academy of Fine Arts in 1991.  He is now a professor at the Digital Media Studio of the Central Academy of Fine Arts (Zhongyang meishu xueyuan shuma meiti gongzuoshi 中央美术学院数码媒体工作室) in Beijing.  In the 1990s, he was among the first artists in China to experiment digital technology. His practice extends to new media art and interactive installations." ;
