    ns2:P1343 "Wang Dongling is the seventh artist featured in \"The Enduring Passion for Ink: Films on Contemporary Ink Painters\", a documentary film independently produced by scholar-curator Britta Erickson in 2013. This documentary presents  10 contemporary Chinese ink artists and opens the door to what contemporary Chinese ink painting represents in the contemporary Chinese art world today."@en ;
